{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"pair_id","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"label","type":{"dtype":"int32","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"id_left","type":{"dtype":"int32","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":3,"name":"category_left","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":4,"name":"cluster_id_left","type":{"dtype":"int32","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":5,"name":"brand_left","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":6,"name":"title_left","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":7,"name":"description_left","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":8,"name":"price_left","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":9,"name":"specTableContent_left","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":10,"name":"id_right","type":{"dtype":"int32","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":11,"name":"category_right","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":12,"name":"cluster_id_right","type":{"dtype":"int32","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":13,"name":"brand_right","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":14,"name":"title_right","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":15,"name":"description_right","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":16,"name":"price_right","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":17,"name":"specTableContent_right","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":100,"row":{"pair_id":"10959814#5072687","label":0,"id_left":10959814,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":474189,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Casio G-Shock GA-100-1A4ER\"@en GA-100-1A4ER - Casio Watches\"@en","description_left":"\"Casio G-Shock GA-100-1A4ER: shock-resistant, magnetic-resistant, countdown timer, stopwatch, daily alarm, 200-meter water resistance.\n\nAuto-LED light\nA light-emitting diode (LED) is used to illuminate the watch face, incl. the feature of an Auto Light Switch that illuminates the display when the watch is angled towards the face.\n\nShock-resistant\nShock-resistant construction protects against impact and vibration.\n\nMagnetic-resistant\nThe housing is designed to shield the clock from magnetic fields.\n\nWorld time function\nDisplays the current time in major cities and specific areas around the world.\n\nStopwatch function - 1/1000 sec. - 100 hours\nElapsed time, split time and final time are measured with 1/1000-sec accuracy. The watch can measure times of up to 100 hours.\n\nTimer - 1/1 min. - 24 hours (with automatic repeat)\nFor fans of precision: the countdown timers help you to remember specific or recurring events by giving off an audible signal at a preset time. They then count back automatically from the preset time. The time can be set to the nearest minute and up to 24 hours in advance. Ideal for people who need to take medicines every day or those who do interval training.\n\n5 daily alarms\nThe daily alarm reminds you about recurring events with an acoustic signal at the time you have set. This model has 5 independent alarms for flexible reminders of important appointments.\n\nSnooze feature\nEach time you stop the alarm, it sounds again after a few minutes.\n\nSpeed display\nThe average speed for a travelled route can be measured. Simply enter the distance at the start and press the stop watch when the destination has been reached - and the average speed is shown.\n\nAutomatic calendar\nOnce set, the automatic calendar always displays the correct date.\n\n12/24-hour timekeeping\nTimes can be displayed in either a 12-hour or 24-hour format.\n\nMineral glass\nThe tough mineral glass resists scratching.\n\nResin band\nSynthetic resin is the ideal material for wrist straps thanks to its extremely durable and flexible properties\n\n2 Years - 1 Battery\nThe battery supplies the watch with sufficient energy for approx. two years.\n\nWater resistance classification (20 bar)\nPerfect for free diving without scuba gear: the watch is water resistant up to 20 bar according to ISO 22810.\n\nChronometric precision\n+/- 15 Seconds per month\n\nDimensions\n55,0 mm x 51,2 mm x 16,9 mm (H x W x D)\n\nWeight\n72,0 g\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5072687,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1331580,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Casio G-Shock G-7710-1ER\"@en G-7710-1ER - Casio Watches\"@en","description_right":"\"Null\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":101,"row":{"pair_id":"11785599#10443457","label":0,"id_left":11785599,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1211681,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Seiko Men's Prospex GMT Diver Kinetic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SUN021P1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This large men's Seiko Prospex Gmt Diver watch has a stainless steel case and is powered by an analogue kinetic movement. It is fastened with a black rubber strap and has a black dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10443457,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":170349,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Seiko Men's Prospex Diver Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SRP775K1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This handsome men's Seiko Prospex Diver watch has a stainless steel case and is powered by an automatic movement. It is fitted with a silver metal  bracelet and has a black dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":102,"row":{"pair_id":"4820505#523073","label":0,"id_left":4820505,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":712172,"brand_left":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_left":" \"Max Bill Ladies´ Watch\"@en \"Junghans Max Watch 047/4659.00 nur € 495.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":523073,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":17971,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Junghans Ladies' Max Bill Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (047/4541.00) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Iconic design, true to the original penned by Max Bill in the 1960's, the Junghans Max Bill Damen is elegant and refined, as well as perfectly simple. Inside the watch is a Junghans Quartz J643.29 movement, with the bare necessities of second, minute and hour, as well as date displayed at 3 o'clock. This is displayed on a matte silver plated dial, beautifully curved, with hour and minutes marked clearly and simply with very slim batons, and luminous markers at the 4 quarters. The case is a stainless steel construction, with curved SICRALAN coated hard plexiglass, true to the original. The watch fastens on a soft vibrant red calfskin leather strap.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":103,"row":{"pair_id":"724975#2575407","label":0,"id_left":724975,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":790009,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Alpina Automatic 4 Watch AL-525SS5AQ6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-525BS5AQ6B | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p>An elegant watch will always deliver sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Alpina brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can surely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Rotating (diver time) bezel, this treasure represents thorough craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting Silver dial color adds a bold sense of luxury. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Central 60 second hand, Date complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. It is also water resistant for 330 ft (100 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Alpina. We are available to answer your questions and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2575407,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11123542,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Cartier Santos De Cartier Galbée Watch W20012C4\" \"Shop W20056D6 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This sleek luxury watch, model number W20012C4 from Cartier offers elegance and first-rate functionality for watch lovers. This Ladies timepiece only hints at the fine watchmaking within this timepiece. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the watch of numerous functionality and exquisite style. A silver dial provides an elegant contrast to the bold and captivating numbers. Its quartz (battery) movement offers excellence in technical innovation. Its complications will make you wonder in awe of the work it took to make this quality timepiece. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The case is expertly created out of 18k yellow gold, both aesthetically pleasing and was crafted to last a long time. The watch’s stainless steel, 18k yellow gold band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features gorgeous 18k yellow gold that speaks volumes. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be found on your wrist. It encircles the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 100 ft (30 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has a stunning selection of watches from the best watchmakers in the world. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":104,"row":{"pair_id":"129217#2527891","label":1,"id_left":129217,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15615272,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Pasha W31079M7\" W31079M7 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2527891,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15615272,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier\" \"CartierCartier Pasha C Steel Black Unisex Watch W31079M7\"","description_right":" \"See a beautiful diamond watch or jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you FREE layaway plan. Just give us toll-free call 1-877-577-TIME send an email sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad take your order\"","price_right":"\"$\", \"$3,798.00\"","specTableContent_right":" Item spec Series Pasha Model Number W31079M7 Size Unisex Case Material Stainless Steel Dial Color Black Dial with Luminescent Diamond-shaped Rhodium plated Steel Hands and arabic Numerals Case Diameter 35mm Bezel Fixed Movement Automatic Band Material Stainless Steel Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Water Resistant 100 meters/330 feet General Item # W31079M7 MSRP $4,220.00 Brand Cartier"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":105,"row":{"pair_id":"17482313#13194642","label":0,"id_left":17482313,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":315882,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Ladies' Bristol Rose 36mm Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (DW00100039) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This slim-line ladies Daniel Wellington Bristol Rose 36mm watch is made from PVD rose plating and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fitted with a brown leather  strap and has a cream dial. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":13194642,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":23461,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Daniel Wellington Ladies' Sheffield Rose 36mm Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (DW00100036) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This slim-line ladies Daniel Wellington Sheffield Rose 36mm watch is made from PVD rose plating and is fitted with a quartz movement. It fastens a black leather  strap and has a cream dial. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":106,"row":{"pair_id":"3826902#5935035","label":1,"id_left":3826902,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":92922,"brand_left":"\"Skagen\"@en","title_left":" \"Holst Men´s Watch\"@en \"Skagen Holst Watch SKW6237 nur € 169.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5935035,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":92922,"brand_right":"\"Skagen\"@de","title_right":" \"Holst Herrenuhr\"@de 00 €\"@de \"Skagen Holst Herrenuhr SKW6237 nur 169","description_right":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 1930 SKW6237\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tModisch-elegante Herrenuhr der Marke Skagen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse ist aus hochwertigen, massiven Edelstahl hergestellt und hat eine polierte Oberfläche.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem blauen Zifferblatt befindet sich ein Skagen Schriftzug.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Zeiger und IndizesIndizes ist das deutsche Wort für das lateinische Index. Spricht man von Indizes, dann sind die Zahlen die die Zeit anzeigen (bei vielen Uhren z.B. arabische Zahlen: 3, 6, 9, 12, aber auch z.B. römische Zahlen: III, VI, IX, XII) oder stattdessen die Platzhalter dafür gemeint. Platzhalter können je nach Gestaltung der Uhr die Unterschiedlichsten Formen haben. Uhrenindexe werden oft nicht nur aufgemalt sondern auch aufgesetzt – bei exklusiven Uhren auch veredelt (mit z.B. Gold, Rosegold, Silber, Chrom). Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon sind mit einer Leuchtmasse gefüllt, damit auch im Dunkeln die Uhrzeit gut lesbar ist.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem Zifferblattrand befindet sich eine vollständige MinuterieAuf dem Zifferblatt umlaufende Einteilung der Minuten, oft zwischen zwei Kreise eingefaßt (‘Eisenbahnminuterie = sieht aus wie Eisenbahnschienen) und teilweise mit ‘5’-Minutenzahlen versehen. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin Mineralglas schützt das Zifferblatt optimal vor äußeren Einflüssen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse hat einen Durchmesser von ca. 40 mm und eine Höhe von ca. 6 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Band ist aus braunem Leder gefertigt und verspricht einen angenehmen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tVerschlossen wird das Lederband mit einer DornschließeEine Dornschließe beschreibt die Verschlussart einer Uhr.  In dem längeren Armbandteil werden löcher gestanzt. Auf der anderen Seite befindet sich die Dornschließe, welche aus einem Dorn und einem Metallbügel in U-Form, diese verhindert, dass der Dorn aus dem Loch rutscht.\nDornschließen sind an diversen Materialien zu finden und erstrecken sich in alle Preisklasse. Häufig findet man Dornschließen bei Lederarmbändern oder Textilarmbändern.\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":107,"row":{"pair_id":"1611917#4528473","label":1,"id_left":1611917,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":382181,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Junghans Men's Max Bill Chronoscope Automatic Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/4600.00) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Iconic design, true to the original penned by Max Bill in the 1960's, the Junghans Max Bill Chronoscope is elegant and refined, as well as perfectly simple. Inside the watch is an Automatic self winding chronograph J880.2 movement, with 30 minute and 12 hour counters on the chronograph, as well as date function. This is displayed on a matt silver plated dial, beautifully curved, with hour and minutes marked clearly and simply. The case is a stainless steel construction, with curved SICRALAN coated hard plexiglass, true to the original. The watch fastens on a black calfskin leather strap.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":4528473,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":382181,"brand_right":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_right":" \"Chronoscope Max Bill\"@en 645.00\"@en \"Junghans Chronoscope Bill 027/4600.00 nur € 1","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":108,"row":{"pair_id":"14218139#7334421","label":0,"id_left":14218139,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1259538,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Raymond Weil Freelancer Watch 2740-ST-20021\" \"Shop Raymond 2760-ST1-20001 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_left":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company in Naperville, IL we offer a large selection of luxury watches.We are happy to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can rest assured that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted for precision and they are purchased for their attention to detail. This 2740-ST-20021 Stainless steel Gents Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7334421,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":9902828,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Raymond Weil Maestro Watch 2238-STC-00659\" \"Shop Raymond 2237-PC-00659 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Naperville’s premier jeweler we offer a comprehensive selection of luxury watches.We are thrilled to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are built to last and they are known for their attention to detail. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":109,"row":{"pair_id":"17557370#5137128","label":0,"id_left":17557370,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":184449,"brand_left":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 GPS + Music Watch Black - Small Strap\"@en Strap · TomTom Running ah\"@en","description_left":"\"\n\nOver 500 Songs of Music Storage* - Carry over 500 songs without carrying your phone.\n24/7 Activity Tracking - Capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt.\nGoal Setting - Challenge yourself to a daily or weekly target. Steps, calories, distance or active time. Set your goal and track your progress.\nMultisport Mode - Train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes.\nGPS Tracking - Track your speed, pace, distance, time and calories burnt.\nAutomatic Sleep Tracking - Know if you're getting the sleep you need.\n5 Heart Rate Training Zones - Train in 5 different zones to get results faster.\nRace Mode - Select one of your past performances to race against.\nInterval Training - Improve speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.\nIndoor Training Mode - Track your performance on the treadmill or in the gym.\n\nSports\n\nTreadmill - Tracks speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nRunning - Tracks speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nCycling - Tracks speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nIndoor Cycling - Tracks duration (Cadence, speed, pace and distance - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nSwimming - Tracks laps, distance, speed, duration, calories burnt and strokes\n\n\nFreestyle - Tracks speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nGym - Tracks duration (Heart rate and calories burnt - through an optional heart rate monitor)\nActivity Tracking\n\nActivity Measurements - Steps, active minutes, distance, calories burnt and sleep\n\n\nViews - Daily and weekly\n\n\nGoals - Steps, active minutes, distance or calories burnt\nTraining\n\nRace - Past activities, favorites and custom\n\n\nGoals - Time, distance or calories\n\n\nZone - Pace, heart rate or speed\n\n\nLaps - Time / Distance / Manual\n\n\nIntervals - Yes\nWeight and Dimensions\n\nBattery lifetime - Activity tracking: up to 3 weeks, GPS: up to 11 hours\n\n\nDisplay resolution - 144x168\n\n\nDisplay size - 22x25 mm\n\n\nThickness - 11.5 mm\n\n\nWeight - 49 g\n\n\nWrist Size - 121-175 mm\nSensors\n\nSensors (internal) - Motion sensor (accelerometer + gyro), compass\n\n\nSensor (wireless) - Bluetooth® Smart\n\n\nAlerts - Beep & Vibrate\nWater Resistance\n\nWaterproofing - 40 m / 130 feet (5 ATM)\n\n\n\n\n\n \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5137128,"category_right":"not found","cluster_id_right":1532315,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio+Music BLK/ANT (Small) - Black/Anthracite\"@en-GB \" TomTom Running Accessories Black/Anthracite \"@en-GB","description_right":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, track your heart rate and capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Cardio + Music.\n\nStore and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. \n\nTrack your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor.\n\nA goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. \n\nGPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  \n\nWinner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category. \n\nDon’t forget to claim your free pair of Bluetooth headphones worth £50 at http://www.tomtom-promotions.com/freeheadphones/ once you’ve purchased your TOMTOM Runner 2 Music watch f\n                                    \n                                \"@en-GB ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":110,"row":{"pair_id":"17353279#11315980","label":0,"id_left":17353279,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":763813,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Raymond Weil Toccata Watch 5488-STC-50001\" \"Shop Raymond 5588-ST-60001 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_left":"\"<p> At Naperville’s premier jeweler we offer a wide selection of luxury watches.We are thrilled to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can rest assured that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted to last and they are loved for their attention to detail. This 5488-STC-50001 Leather Gents Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11315980,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":182051,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Raymond Weil Toccata Watch 5488-ST-50001\" \"Shop Raymond 5588-STC-20001 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Naperville’s premier jeweler we offer a wide selection of luxury timepieces.We are delighted to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can feel confident that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are built for reliability and they are loved for their luxurious details. This 5488-ST-50001 Stainless steel Gents Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":111,"row":{"pair_id":"986009#6237463","label":0,"id_left":986009,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":378127,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Casio Men's Pro-Trek Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (PRG-300-1A2ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This large men's Casio Pro-trek watch has a plastic/resin case and is powered by a chronograph quartz movement. It is fastened with a black plastic/resin strap and has a LCD dial.  The watch also has a date function.  Includes alarm function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6237463,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":423821,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Pulsar Men's Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (PT3161X1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This handsome gents Pulsar watch has a stainless steel case and is powered by a chronograph quartz movement. It is fitted with a silver metal  bracelet and has a black dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":112,"row":{"pair_id":"4820505#945802","label":0,"id_left":4820505,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":712172,"brand_left":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_left":" \"Max Bill Ladies´ Watch\"@en \"Junghans Max Watch 047/4659.00 nur € 495.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":945802,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":12081419,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Bvlgari Tubogas Watch SP35BDSDS.2T\" SPP35D2GDG.2T | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A fine timepiece makes a bold statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical device, a fine timepiece can also showcase your style. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are delighted to offer diverse selection of some of the worldâ€™s most beloved luxury watch brands, including Bvlgari. We are also proud to be an authorized Bvlgari retailer in Los Angeles. Bvlgari's extraordinary timepieces are crafted to endure. This Ladies watch with model number SP35BDSDS.2T is part of the unique Tubogas collection.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":113,"row":{"pair_id":"7651326#1725480","label":0,"id_left":7651326,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":81467,"brand_left":"\"Casio\"","title_left":" \"Casio GA-110GB-1AER G-Shock watch\"","description_left":"\"            \t                    This beautiful sports Casio G-shock watch features a plastic case fitted with a Plastic /silicone based strap. Besides that this watch is a very nice piece of jewelry on your arm, it also still has very useful features, like alarm, chronograph. These trendy watches have all the features in it for the sports person. Performed in many different colors and digital functions it can be used for each sport.  2 year guarantee on the movement. Comes in luxury brandbox.            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":1725480,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":343788,"brand_right":"\"Casio\"","title_right":" \"Casio LA670WEA-1EF Retro watch\"","description_right":"\"            \t                    This eye catcher by Casio LA670WEA-1EF is a ladies watch that can be worn on any occasion. The silver colored stainless steel is very beneficial to the comfort level. You hardly feel that you wear the watch. The rectangular silver colored case ensures a beautiful appearance. These trendy watches have all the features in it for the sports person. Performed in many different colors and digital functions it can be used for each sport.  if necessary a tool is provided to shorten the band of your watch. 2 year guarantee on the movement. Comes in luxury brandbox.Stopwatch function - 1/100 sec. - 1 hourElapsed time, split time and final time are measured with an accuracy of 1/100 sec. The watch can measure times of up to 1 hour.Day alarmThe daily recurring events you will be reminded by the daily alarm, an audible signal at the set time.automatic calendarIf the automatic calendar has been set, always displays the correct date.2 Years - 1 BatteryThe battery supplies the watch about 2 years of power.            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":114,"row":{"pair_id":"1492146#7140048","label":0,"id_left":1492146,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15979834,"brand_left":"\"Watchtag\"","title_left":" \"Tissot T-Sport V8 Chronograph Men's Watch T36131672\" \" Tissot T36131672 | watchtag.com\"","description_left":"\"\n                Stainless steel case. Brown leather strap with contrast stitching. Cream dial. Date displays at 6 o'clock position. Chronograph. Tachymeter. Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. Tang clasp. Case diameter 43mm. Case thickness 10mm. Quartz movement. Water resistant 100 metres 330 feet.            \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Movement Quartz Case Type Stainless Steel Case Colour Stainless Steel Analogue / Digital Analogue Strap Colour Brown Strap Type Leather Date Yes Chronograph Yes Dial Colour Other Case Size 43.0 mm Water Resistance 100m (330ft)","id_right":7140048,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":568147,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Tissot Men's PRS200 Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0674171103101) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Mens Tissot PRS200 watch in stainless steel, set around a multi-dial display with date function and chronograph.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":115,"row":{"pair_id":"17557314#17557340","label":1,"id_left":17557314,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15748134,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Longines Master Collection Watch L2.628.4.51.7\" \"Shop Longines L2.128.4.57.6 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This exceptional timepiece, model number L2.628.4.51.7 from Longines provides elegance and high tech functionality for your everyday fashion. This Gents timepiece expresses a flawless and sophisticated character. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the watch of enormous functionality and distinct style. A black dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. Its automatic (self winding) movement offers excellence in technical innovation. This watch includes central 60 second hand, date complications. Its complications greatly increase your watch’s functionality. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The neat round case is 38 mm. The case is artfully created out of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has sleek, elegant, and luxurious watches for any price level. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557340,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15748134,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Longines Master Collection Watch L2.628.4.51.7\" \"Shop Longines L2.518.5.12.7 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This exceptional timepiece, model number L2.628.4.51.7 from Longines provides elegance and high tech functionality for your everyday fashion. This Gents timepiece expresses a flawless and sophisticated character. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the watch of enormous functionality and distinct style. A black dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. Its automatic (self winding) movement offers excellence in technical innovation. This watch includes central 60 second hand, date complications. Its complications greatly increase your watch’s functionality. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The neat round case is 38 mm. The case is artfully created out of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has sleek, elegant, and luxurious watches for any price level. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":116,"row":{"pair_id":"8878082#6479456","label":0,"id_left":8878082,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":3559175,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"TomTom Spark 3 Cardio (Large) - Black\"@en-GB \" TomTom Black Accessories 1RK0.002.00 \"@en-GB","description_left":"\"\n                                    Mix up your training and track different sports with the dedicated multisport mode. Get real-time stats on the go, including time, distance, speed and pace, thanks to the 24/7 activity tracking and inbuilt GPS tracker. The TomTom Spark 3 Cardio also monitors you heart rate, step count and sleep. With its water resistant design, up to 40m, you can wear it during outdoor activities such as running or cycling in the rain and even track your swimming.\n\nExplore new areas without the worry of getting lost, thanks to the route exploration feature, which displays your trail and allows you to easily navigate your way back home. \n\nWith a wireless syncing feature, you can sync, share and study your activity data with your favourite workout apps like Strava, Runkeeper, MapMyFitness, NikePlus or Endomondo. \n\nTo get the best and most secure fit, it is recommended that you measure your wrist before purchasing the TomTom Spark 3 Cardio. This watch is suitable for wrist sizes between 143-206mm.\n                                    \n                                \"@en-GB ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6479456,"category_right":"not found","cluster_id_right":1553627,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Spark Fit - (Large) Black\"@en \" TomTom Black Accessories 1RE0.002.01 \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Track your way to a fitter, healthier you with the TomTom Spark Fit Cardio Fitness Watch. With 24/7 GPS activity tracking, the watch will capture everything you need to know about your lifestyle and exercise routine, including time, distance, calories burned and steps taken.Whether you’re playing tennis or going for a run, hitting the gym or going for a swim, you can take your workout one step further by setting yourself daily or weekly goals.Features Include:Tracks calories burned distance travelled pace speed steps taken and hours sleptWater-resistant design protects the watch in water or while you run in the rainWireless syncingFits large wrist sizesMultisport mode lets you track run bike swim gym and treadmill modesUltra-Slim designGoal setting to monitor daily and weekly goals\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":117,"row":{"pair_id":"4105663#3640849","label":0,"id_left":4105663,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":142233,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Junghans Men's Max Bill Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/4002.44) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Iconic design, true to the original penned by Max Bill in the 1960's, the Junghans Max Bill Chronoscope is elegant and refined, as well as perfectly simple. Inside the watch is a Junghans self winding automatic mechanical J800.1 movement, with the bare necessities of second, minute and hour, plus date window at 3 o'clock. This is displayed on a matte silver plated dial, beautifully curved, with hour and minutes marked clearly and simply with very slim batons, and luminous markers at the 4 quarters. The case is a stainless steel construction, with curved SICRALAN coated hard plexiglass, true to the original. The watch fastens on a fine milanese mesh steel bracelet with safety clasp.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":3640849,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":10672859,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Crystal South Horizons Blue Watch\"@en \"Versus Versace Crystal Watch for Women | US Online Store\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":118,"row":{"pair_id":"15045977#6018986","label":0,"id_left":15045977,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":547135,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Tissot Men's PRC200 Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0554301105700) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This handsome men's Tissot Prc200 watch is made from stainless steel and is powered by an automatic movement. It is fastened with a silver metal  bracelet and has a grey dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6018986,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":278516,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Tissot Ladies' PRC200 Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (T0552171603202) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This ladies Tissot Prc200 watch is made from stainless steel and is powered by an analogue chronograph quartz movement. It is fastened with a black leather  strap and has a white dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":119,"row":{"pair_id":"15045977#8496433","label":0,"id_left":15045977,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":547135,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Tissot Men's PRC200 Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0554301105700) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This handsome men's Tissot Prc200 watch is made from stainless steel and is powered by an automatic movement. It is fastened with a silver metal  bracelet and has a grey dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8496433,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":5317419,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Panerai Radiomir 1940 Watch PAM00514\" \"Shop Panerai PAM00515 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This exceptional watch, model number PAM00514 from Panerai gives style and first-rate functionality for watch lovers. This Gents timepiece adopts a distinctive design as well as classic watchmaking details. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of insurmountable functionality and distinct style. A black dial provides superior readability. Its manual winding movement has world-class mechanics that can stand the test of time. This watch includes small second hand, date complications. Its complications are distinctively positioned for easy reading. The numbers on this timepiece are in indexes, arabic style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The case is artfully crafted of stainless steel, both eye catching and was crafted to last a long time. The watch’s leather band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features gorgeous stainless steel that speaks volumes. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be by your side. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 330 ft (100 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has everything from simple timepieces to ones you’ll want to keep in the family forever. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":120,"row":{"pair_id":"11410756#2338441","label":0,"id_left":11410756,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":353191,"brand_left":"\"Suunto\"@en","title_left":" \"SUUNTO TRAVERSE ALPHA STEALTH\"@en apparel and sports equipment\"@en STEALTH - TREKKING WATCH Suunto colour Black SS022469000 Athletic footwear","description_left":"\"<p>Suunto sports watch Alpha Traverse Stealth GPS/Glonass functionality. Outdoor activities will always be under control with this new versatile and reliable measurement and navigation tool. The Alpha version is designed for outdoor works related to hunting and fishing.</p>\n<p>Go Explore<br>Suunto Traverse Alpha conjugates qualities of a sturdy structure and a full range of features for outdoors. Is your guide in the wilderness, which helps keep the GPS/GLONASS navigation guidance. Specific features for hunting and fishing will provide useful tools for your business, including the timing of lunar phases, stroke detection, the alert dawn, the weather trend indicator, and the red backlight for night use. Plan routes and keep a diary of your fishing and hunting outings with SuunTo Movescount.com.<p>\n<p>The moon phase calendar based on the position with the time of rise and decline of the Moon helps you determine the best times for fishing, while the barometric pressure graph allows you to precisely follow the weather changes.</p>\n<p>Automatic identification of hit tracks the number and position of the strokes. While exploring, you can use the specific POI to mark the routes and important positions. Sunrise and sunset Alerts help you plan your day, while customizable red backlight does not interfere with your night vision.</p>\n<p>Create routes on Suunto Movescount with topographic maps and elevation data. View profile of altitude of your itinerary directly from the watch. The atmospheric pressure measurement integrated sensor keeps track of your climb with precision. Save points of interest along the route and,If necessary, retrace your steps with the automatic route tracking feature (breadcrumb). Using the digital compass to orient yourself quickly on unknown territory.<p>\n<p>With knurled stainless steel bezel, black nylon strap waterproof and scratch-resistant Sapphire Crystal, Suunto Traverse Alpha is the perfect watch for hunters, fishermen and hikers who want an extremely durable. Vibrating alerts and the red backlight, compatible with night vision goggles, they make you go unnoticed.</p>\n<p>Outdoor watches, Suunto sleepers and Traverse Alpha have been tested in accordance with military standards (MIL STD 819G). Have passed the 19 tests, including tests for vibration, shock, drop, freezing and thawing, rain, humidity, immersion, dust and sand.</p>\n<p>Dominates the area with GPS/GLONASS navigation: uses features specific to the cacCIA, fishing and hiking. Suunto Traverse is manufactured in Finland and tested according to military standards.<p>\n<p>Main features:<br>-How hiking, fishing and hunting<br>-Hours and warnings of sunrise and sunset<br>-POI types specific to fishing and hunting<br>-Moon phases and times of rise and decline of the Moon<br>-Automatic detection of stroke<br>-Red Backlight, night vision compatible<br>-GPS and GLONASS for sailing routes and POIs<br>-Automatic route tracking feature (breadcrumb) in real time<br>-Detection of speed, distance and altitude<br>-Route planning in Suunto Movescount.com with topographic maps<br>-Preview of route and altitude profile of the route on the clock<br>-Water resistance to 100 m/330 feet<br>-Altitude (FusedAlti ™)<br>Weather trends and storm alarm<br>-Knockthe<br>-Backlight flashlight mode<br>-Vibration<br>-GPS update now<br>-Monitoring of steps and calories during daily activities, weekly, monthly, and yearly<br>-Notifications on your phone<br>-Compatible with Suunto Movescount (iOS and Android)<p>\n<p>Package contents:<br>-Suunto Traverse Alpha Stealth<br>-USB cable<br>-Quick Start Guide<br>-Warranty information</p>\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" SKU SS022469000 Size S.T. Brand Suunto Product category Trekking Watch Color Black EAN 6417084201928","id_right":2338441,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":7797639,"brand_right":"\"Suunto\"@en","title_right":" \"SUUNTO M2 MEN LIME\"@en apparel and sports equipment\"@en LIME - HEART RATE MONITOR Suunto colour SS020647000 Athletic footwear","description_right":"\"<p>Heart rate monitor Suunto M2 Black template files.</p>\n<p>Suunto heart rate monitor at a very attractive price! Ease of use thanks to a three-button interface, configurable software in Italian (nine languages available: Italian, English, French, German, Spanish, Dutch, Portuguese, Finnish, Swedish).</p>\n<p>A heart rate monitor, ideal for fitness, gym, running, cycling, and other sports where it is important to keep your heart rate monitored. Equipped by Dual Comfort Belt chest strap included in the package.</p>\n<p><strong>FUNCTIONS</strong><br>-Real-time heart rate<br>-Real-time Calories<br>-Guided Training in real time<br>-Three heart rate zones<br>-Automatic switching between three heart rate zones<br>-9 Menu languages</p>\n<p><strong>SPECIFICATIONS</strong><br>-30 m Water Resistant (according to ISO 6425)<br>-12 months battery autonomy in time mode<br>-Battery type: CR2032 (battery user-replaceable)<br>-Time and date Display<br>-daily alarm 1<br>-Dual time<br>-Stopwatch<br>-User interface Languages: EN, DE, ES, FI,? FR, IT, NL, PT, SV<br>-Button lock function<br>-Matrix Display<br>-Indicator low battery level<br>-Metric units or Imperial</p>\n<p>Colour: Black/Lime (cod. SS020647000)</p>\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" SKU SS020647000 Size S.T. Brand Suunto Product category Heart Rate Monitor Color No"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":121,"row":{"pair_id":"14272447#14225300","label":0,"id_left":14272447,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":761757,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Junghans Men's Meister Kalendar Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/4200.00) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"First built in the 1930s and improved into the 1960s to the watches we see in the collection today, the elegant Meister series of watches bear eloquent witness to Junghans� expertise in mechanical watchmaking, and the highest levels of their design, expertise and craftsmanship.\n\n\nThe Meister Calendar is a celebration of Junghans' expertise. The movement is a delight, an automatic movement featuring day, date, month and moonphase. This wealth of information is displayed elegantly, with no fuss and clutter, on a simple matt silver dial with baton markers and the simple Junghans logo. Covering the dial is curved plexiglass, with SICRALAN hardening to protect against scratches and knocks. The movement sits inside a simple, elegant stainless steel case, comfortably sized and curved to sit perfectly on the wrist, and is fastened on a soft, comfortable leather strap.\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14225300,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":59451,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Junghans Men's Meister Chronoscope Automatic Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/4324.44) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Meister is Junghans' expression of the style of their classic watches, while staying true to the principles of the finest materials and technological improvements. Refined aesthetics, reminiscent of the watches designed by Anton Ziegler for the brand between 1930 and 1960.\n\nInside the watch is an Automatic self winding chronograph J880.2 movement, with 30 minute and 12 hour counters for the chronograph, as well as sub second, and day and date function. This is displayed on a sunray brushed dark grey dial,  with hour and minutes marked clearly and simply. The case is a stainless steel construction featuring exhibition case back, with curved SICRALAN coated hard plexiglass, true to the original, giving it an elegant curvature to the dial. The watch fastens on a 9 link stainless steel bracelet, polished and matte finished for a perfect accompaniment to the case and dial.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":122,"row":{"pair_id":"12575300#2868568","label":0,"id_left":12575300,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1401382,"brand_left":"\"Tag Heuer\"","title_left":" \"Tag Heuer Carrera CAR2A1Z.FT6044\" CAR2A1Z.FT6044 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            In both name and spirit, the Calibre 01 represents the first of what is expected to become a series of modernised upgrades for TAG Heuer timepieces masterminded by legend of the watchmaking world, Jean-Claude Biver. This model sees the familiar and iconic shape of the Carrera enhanced with an avant-garde (and larger) case build and a striking skeletonised dial. The 45mm titanium-carbide coated case is modular in design, constructed entirely in-house. The same goes for the movement (a modified version of the brand's superb Cal. 1887), which together with the skeletonisation and the red highlights creates a hi-tech aesthetic that builds on the watch's historical race car legacy.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Tag Heuer has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Tag Heuer certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2868568,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":146520,"brand_right":"\"Tag Heuer\"","title_right":" \"Tag Heuer Formula 1 WAH1313.BA0868\" WAH1313.BA0868 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Tag Heuer has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Tag Heuer certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":123,"row":{"pair_id":"9943517#8873393","label":0,"id_left":9943517,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":202373,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Hamilton Men's Khaki Below Zero 1000m Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (H78585333) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"High-impact mens Hamilton Khaki Below Zero model in all black, featuring date function, numeral hour markers, sapphire glass and a rubber strap.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8873393,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":81230,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Hamilton Men's Jazzmaster Automatic Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (H32616533) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This men's Hamilton Jazzmaster watch has a stainless steel case and is fitted with a chronograph automatic movement. It is fastened with a black leather  strap and has a black dial.  The watch also has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":124,"row":{"pair_id":"4528473#8732193","label":0,"id_left":4528473,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":382181,"brand_left":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_left":" \"Chronoscope Max Bill\"@en 645.00\"@en \"Junghans Chronoscope Bill 027/4600.00 nur € 1","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8732193,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":453784,"brand_right":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_right":" \"Hand-winding Max Bill\"@en \"Junghans Hand-winding Bill 027/5703.00 nur € 675.00\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" General Target Group: Mens Case housing diameter: 33 mm Shape: Round glass: Synthetic crystal Material: Stainless steel"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":125,"row":{"pair_id":"14799144#14144442","label":0,"id_left":14799144,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":109161,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Men's Glasgow 40mm Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DW00100004) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This slim-line gents Daniel Wellington Glasgow 40mm watch is made from PVD rose plating and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fastened with a multicolour fabric strap and has a cream dial. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14144442,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":930177,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Daniel Wellington Ladies' Dapper 34mm Reading Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (DW00100118) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This men's Daniel Wellington Dapper 34mm Reading watch has a PVD rose plating case and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fastened with a black leather  strap and has a off white dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":126,"row":{"pair_id":"1969353#13078076","label":0,"id_left":1969353,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":320278,"brand_left":"\"Tissot\"@en","title_left":" \" Tissot Classic Dream Watch \"@en \"Tissot - T0332101611100 | Ben Bridge Jeweler\"@en","description_left":"\"Tissot T-Classic quartz watch in stainless steel with a leather strap.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":13078076,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":451950,"brand_right":"\"Tissot\"@en","title_right":" \" Tissot Classi-T Watch \"@en \"Tissot - T0290093303701 | Ben Bridge Jeweler\"@en","description_right":"\"25.3mm Tissot Classi-T watch in stainless steel with gold-tone PVD coating, chain bracelet, sapphire crystal, and Swiss quartz movement. Part of the T-Classic collection.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":127,"row":{"pair_id":"7272784#16669971","label":0,"id_left":7272784,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":9006964,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Suunto Ambit 3 Sports with HR - Black\"@en \" Suunto Heart Rate Accessories Black \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Keep track of your heart rate and running performance while you work out with this multisport watch for a personalised experience. Use with the free Suunto Movescount App to plan your workouts and get voice guidance during your workout. You can also adjust the watch on the go and share your experience with others. Features Include:15h battery life with 5-sec GPS accuracy.Speed pace distance and GPS altitude.Route navigation and track back.Compass.Heart rate in swimming.Bike power support (Bluetooth Smart).Multiple sports in one log.Interval workout planner.Interval workouts with voice guidance.Activity based recovery time.Quick recovery and sleep recovery tests (Firstbeat).Movescount training programs on watch.Extended feature set through Suunto Apps.Languages: EN CS DA DE ES FI FR IT JA KO NL NO PL PT RU SV ZH.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":16669971,"category_right":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_right":3559175,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Spark 3 HR (Large) - Black\"@en \" TomTom Cardio Black Accessories 1RK0.002.00 \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Mix up your training and track different sports with the dedicated multisport mode. Get real-time stats on the go, including time, distance, speed and pace, thanks to the 24/7 activity tracking and inbuilt GPS tracker. The TomTom Spark 3 Cardio also monitors you heart rate, step count and sleep. With its water resistant design, up to 40m, you can wear it during outdoor activities such as running or cycling in the rain and even track your swimming.Explore new areas without the worry of getting lost, thanks to the route exploration feature, which displays your trail and allows you to easily navigate your way back home. With a wireless syncing feature, you can sync, share and study your activity data with your favourite workout apps like Strava, Runkeeper, MapMyFitness, NikePlus or Endomondo. To get the best and most secure fit, it is recommended that you measure your wrist before purchasing the TomTom Spark 3 Cardio. This watch is suitable for wrist sizes between 143-206mm.Features Include:24/7 activity trackingGPS trackingMultisport modeRoute explorationBuilt-in heart rate monitorIndoor training modeWireless syncingCustomisable strapsWater resistantLong battery life - up to 10 hours of battery lifetime when tracking with GPSDisplay size: 22 x 25 mmWrist size: 143-206 mm\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":128,"row":{"pair_id":"1923175#4515022","label":1,"id_left":1923175,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1281015,"brand_left":"\"Nixon\"@es","title_left":" \"The Facet 38 Plum\"@es \"Nixon The Plum A4092157 nur 129 00 €\"@es","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Carcasa Diametro: 38 mm Forma: Redondo Color de la carcasa: Plateado cristal: Cristal mineral Material: Acero inoxidable","id_right":4515022,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1281015,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Facet 38 Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A409-2157) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This ladies Nixon The Facet 38 watch is made from stainless steel and is powered by a quartz movement. It fastens a silver metal  bracelet and has a purple dial. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":129,"row":{"pair_id":"727263#14689640","label":0,"id_left":727263,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":66696,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Mens Nixon The Brigade Watch A1176-001 \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men Hut\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14689640,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":363918,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Mens Sekonda Watch 1350 \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men The Hut\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":130,"row":{"pair_id":"16926836#14100885","label":1,"id_left":16926836,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":10396858,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Reloj Polar V800-Negro/Plateado\"@es \" Reloj V800-GPS-Accesorios para correr-Negro/Plateado \"@es","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14100885,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":10396858,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Polar V800 Watch - Black/Silver\"@en-GB \" Accessories Polar Black/Silver 92052229 \"@en-GB","description_right":"\"\n                                    Polar V800 Watch - Black/Silver\n\nThe V800 from Polar is a Smart Coaching and GPS watch for peak performance that measures a multitude of training data for professional and amateur athletes. The Polar Watch V800 has integrated GPS for speed, distance and route (altitude from barometer), Route guidance & Back-to-Start.\n\n\n                                    \n                                \"@en-GB ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":131,"row":{"pair_id":"16801286#8630497","label":1,"id_left":16801286,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":373267,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Casio Men's G-Shock Rangeman Alarm Chronograph Radio Controlled Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (GW-9400-1ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"An oversized design from G-Shock by Casio. This Rangerman edition has a large 53mm case and LCD dial. This watch is jam packed with features such as Super-Full-Auto-LED light, Shock resistant, Solar Power, Radio signal reception (EU, USA, Japan, China),  Barometer (260 / 1.100 hPa), Thermometer (-10�C / +60�C), Digital-compass, 10,000 m Altimeter, Sunrise/sunset display, Altimeter data memory, World time function, Stopwatch function - 1/100 sec - 1.000 hours, Timer - 1/1 min. - 24 hours, 5 daily alarms, Snooze feature, Button tones on/off, Automatic calendar, 12/24-hour timekeeping, Mineral glass, Resin case, Resin band, Battery level indicator and Water resistance classification (20 bar). \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8630497,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":373267,"brand_right":"\"Casio\"@de","title_right":" \"G-Shock Rangeman Herrenuhr\"@de \"Casio G-Shock Herrenuhr GW-9400-1ER nur 299 00 €\"@de","description_right":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 4216 GW-9400-1ER\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tSportliche Digitaluhr für Herren der Marke Casio.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Logo ist befindet sich auf dem schwarzen Gehäuse.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr macht einiges mit, ohne Schaden zu nehmen. Die Stoßfestigkeit bietet Schutz bei Aufprall und Erschütterungen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür das Super Full Auto LED Light genügt eine leichte Drehung des Handgelenks, um den Hintergrund der Uhr besonders hell in einer modischen Farbe zu beleuchten.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tUnabhängig und umweltfreundlich sorgen Solarzellen für die Energieversorgung der Uhr. Überschüssige Solarenergie wird in einem Akku gespeichert.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin spezieller Sensor misst den Luftdruck (Messbereich: 260/1.100 hPa.) und zeigt diesen symbolisch auf dem Display an. Damit ist es möglich, vorzeitig Wettertendenzen zu erkennen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin Sensor misst die Umgebungstemperatur der Uhr und zeigt diese in Grad CelsiusGrad Celsius ist eine Maßeinheit der Temperatur. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon (-10°C /+60°C) an.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin Richtungssensor stellt die magnetische Nord-Richtung fest und zeigt diese digital an.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin Drucksensor stellt Änderungen im Luftdruck fest und rechnet das Ergebnis in Höhenangaben bis 10.000 m um.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tNach Eingabe der geografischen Lage können die Sonnenauf- und -untergangszeiten für jedes beliebige Datum angezeigt werden.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Weltzeit Funktion zeigt die Uhrzeiten in bis zu 29 verschiedenen ZeitzonenEs gibt insgesamt 24 Zeitzonen, die je 15 Längengrade umfassen und beim Nullmeridian beginnen. Beim Übergang von einer zur folgenden Zeitzone verschiebt sich die Zeit um eine Stunde. Je nach Himmelsrichtung verschiebt sich die Zeit entweder eine Stunde nach hinten ( Westen) oder nach vorne (Osten).\nDie wichtigsten internationalen Zeitsignale sind: DCF77 (Deutschland) in Mainflingen in Hessen, MSF (Großbritannien) in Anthorn, JJY (Japan), WWV (USA) in Fort Collins, WWVH (USA) auf Hawaii, BPC (China) in Shangqiu\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon an.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDer Countdown-Timer hilft bei der Erinnerung an besondere oder wiederkehrende Ereignisse, indem er zum eingestellten Zeitpunkt ein akustisches Signal abgibt.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAn täglich wiederkehrende Ereignisse erinnert der Tagesalarm, bei dem ein akustisches Signal zum eingestellten Zeitpunkt ertönt. Zusätzlich macht ein abstellbarer Alarm auf den Ablauf jeder vollen Stunde aufmerksam.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf Wunsch können die Tastentöne mit der Modetaste abgeschaltet werden. Nach dem Abschalten gibt es dann keinen Piepton mehr, wenn von einer Funktion in die nächste gewechselt wird.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEinmal eingestellt zeigt der automatische Kalender immer das richtige Datum an.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Zeitanzeige ist wahlweise einstellbar auf 12- oder 24-Stunden-Format.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas harte, kratzfeste Mineralglas schützt die Uhr vor Beschädigungen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr ist wasserdicht bis 20 Bar / 200 Meter. Die Meter Angabe bezieht sich nicht auf eine Tauchtiefe, sondern auf den Luftdruck, welcher im Rahmen der WasserdichtigkeitsprDie Angaben über die  Wasserdichtigkeit von Uhren führen immer wieder zu Missverständnissen, da die  angegebenen Meterangaben meist wenig Aussagekraft haben. Im Folgenden nun ein  paar Richtlinien, die den richtigen Umgang mit ihrer Uhr und Wasser erleichtern  sollen:\nEs kann auch vorkommen, dass die Angabe der Wasserdichtigkeit in Bar statt Metern vorliegt. Dies ist  dann folgendermaßen zu verstehen:\n3 bar = 30 m / 5 bar = 50 m  / 10 bar = 100 m / 20 bar = 200 m \t Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikonüfung angewendet wurde. (ISO 22810)\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tMit dieser Kontrollanzeige hat man die Batterieladung der Uhr jederzeit im Blick.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tResin besteht aus Kunstharz und ist durch seine extreme Haltbarkeit und seine Flexibilität das ideale Material für Armbänder.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":132,"row":{"pair_id":"17557315#17557279","label":1,"id_left":17557315,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":597042,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Seaview Chrono Quartz Watch H37512131\" \"Shop Hamilton Collection at Safa Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p> A luxurious watch is more than just practical for telling time, it is also a incredible piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H37512131 watch is from the finely crafted Seaview Chrono Quartz collection. It features a precise Quartz (battery) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 330 ft (100 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. </p>\n<p> Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This stylish timepiece is a spectacular way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is proud to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can exquisite timepieces are built to last and will be loved for years to come. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557279,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":597042,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Seaview Chrono Quartz H37512131\" \"Seaview Quartz\"","description_right":"\"<p> Metals in Time is known for having a vast selection of sophisticated luxury timepieces, from the most beloved watch brands. We offer only the best timepieces and we provide exceptional service to go along with it. There is nothing quite as delightful as owning a finely crafted watch. It makes a stunning statement and is as fashionable as it is practical. We know that timepieces come with a variety of features and functions and our knowledgeable staff will help you navigate through our inventory to find the perfect timepiece to suit your needs. </p>\n<p> This H37512131 Hamilton watch is from the exquisite Seaview Chrono Quartz collection. Hamilton fine timepieces are both practical and fashionable. This H37512131 Stainless steel Gents Hamilton timepiece features a resilient Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are searching  for a sophisticated or comfortable  watch, we have just what you want. Shop with confidence knowing Metals in Time is an authorized Hamilton dealer. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":133,"row":{"pair_id":"10959814#14760086","label":0,"id_left":10959814,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":474189,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Casio G-Shock GA-100-1A4ER\"@en GA-100-1A4ER - Casio Watches\"@en","description_left":"\"Casio G-Shock GA-100-1A4ER: shock-resistant, magnetic-resistant, countdown timer, stopwatch, daily alarm, 200-meter water resistance.\n\nAuto-LED light\nA light-emitting diode (LED) is used to illuminate the watch face, incl. the feature of an Auto Light Switch that illuminates the display when the watch is angled towards the face.\n\nShock-resistant\nShock-resistant construction protects against impact and vibration.\n\nMagnetic-resistant\nThe housing is designed to shield the clock from magnetic fields.\n\nWorld time function\nDisplays the current time in major cities and specific areas around the world.\n\nStopwatch function - 1/1000 sec. - 100 hours\nElapsed time, split time and final time are measured with 1/1000-sec accuracy. The watch can measure times of up to 100 hours.\n\nTimer - 1/1 min. - 24 hours (with automatic repeat)\nFor fans of precision: the countdown timers help you to remember specific or recurring events by giving off an audible signal at a preset time. They then count back automatically from the preset time. The time can be set to the nearest minute and up to 24 hours in advance. Ideal for people who need to take medicines every day or those who do interval training.\n\n5 daily alarms\nThe daily alarm reminds you about recurring events with an acoustic signal at the time you have set. This model has 5 independent alarms for flexible reminders of important appointments.\n\nSnooze feature\nEach time you stop the alarm, it sounds again after a few minutes.\n\nSpeed display\nThe average speed for a travelled route can be measured. Simply enter the distance at the start and press the stop watch when the destination has been reached - and the average speed is shown.\n\nAutomatic calendar\nOnce set, the automatic calendar always displays the correct date.\n\n12/24-hour timekeeping\nTimes can be displayed in either a 12-hour or 24-hour format.\n\nMineral glass\nThe tough mineral glass resists scratching.\n\nResin band\nSynthetic resin is the ideal material for wrist straps thanks to its extremely durable and flexible properties\n\n2 Years - 1 Battery\nThe battery supplies the watch with sufficient energy for approx. two years.\n\nWater resistance classification (20 bar)\nPerfect for free diving without scuba gear: the watch is water resistant up to 20 bar according to ISO 22810.\n\nChronometric precision\n+/- 15 Seconds per month\n\nDimensions\n55,0 mm x 51,2 mm x 16,9 mm (H x W x D)\n\nWeight\n72,0 g\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14760086,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":112847,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Casio G-Shock GA-100-1A2\"@en GA-100-1A2 - Casio Watches\"@en","description_right":"\"Casio G-Shock GA-100-1A2ER: shock-resistant, magnetic-resistant, countdown timer, stopwatch, daily alarm, 200-meter water resistance.\n\nAuto-LED light\nA light-emitting diode (LED) is used to illuminate the watch face, incl. the feature of an Auto Light Switch that illuminates the display when the watch is angled towards the face.\n\nShock-resistant\nShock-resistant construction protects against impact and vibration.\n\nMagnetic-resistant\nThe housing is designed to shield the clock from magnetic fields.\n\nWorld time function\nDisplays the current time in major cities and specific areas around the world.\n\nStopwatch function - 1/1000 sec. - 100 hours\nElapsed time, split time and final time are measured with 1/1000-sec accuracy. The watch can measure times of up to 100 hours.\n\nTimer - 1/1 min. - 24 hours (with automatic repeat)\nFor fans of precision: the countdown timers help you to remember specific or recurring events by giving off an audible signal at a preset time. They then count back automatically from the preset time. The time can be set to the nearest minute and up to 24 hours in advance. Ideal for people who need to take medicines every day or those who do interval training.\n\n5 daily alarms\nThe daily alarm reminds you about recurring events with an acoustic signal at the time you have set. This model has 5 independent alarms for flexible reminders of important appointments.\n\nSnooze feature\nEach time you stop the alarm, it sounds again after a few minutes.\n\nSpeed display\nThe average speed for a travelled route can be measured. Simply enter the distance at the start and press the stop watch when the destination has been reached - and the average speed is shown.\n\nAutomatic calendar\nOnce set, the automatic calendar always displays the correct date.\n\n12/24-hour timekeeping\nTimes can be displayed in either a 12-hour or 24-hour format.\n\nMineral glass\nThe tough mineral glass resists scratching.\n\nResin band\nSynthetic resin is the ideal material for wrist straps thanks to its extremely durable and flexible properties\n\n2 Years - 1 Battery\nThe battery supplies the watch with sufficient energy for approx. two years.\n\nWater resistance classification (20 bar)\nPerfect for free diving without scuba gear: the watch is water resistant up to 20 bar according to ISO 22810.\n\nChronometric precision\n+/- 15 Seconds per month\n\nDimensions\n55,0 mm x 51,2 mm x 16,9 mm (H x W x D)\n\nWeight\n72,0 g\n\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":134,"row":{"pair_id":"13408327#17557263","label":0,"id_left":13408327,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1604303,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Michele Signature Deco MWW06P000171\" \"MWW06P000171 New Michele Diamond Ladies Quartz Watch\"","description_left":"\" MWW06P000171  NEW MICHELE SIGNATURE DECO DIAMOND WOMEN'S LUXURY WATCHBlack Friday Sales Event - IN STOCK  - FREE Overnight Shipping | Lowest Price Guaranteed\n- No Sales Tax (Outside California)\n- With Manufacturer Serial Numbers\n- Black Mother Of Pearl Dial with Diamonds  \n- Diamonds Set on Bezel \n- 120 Total Diamonds (.66ct) \n- Chronograph Feature \n-  Battery Operated Quartz Movement\n- 3 Year Warranty\n- Guaranteed Authentic  \n- Certificate of Authenticity\n- Manufacturer Box & E Manual (will be sent by email) \n- Polished Steel Case & Bracelet \n- Scratch Resistant Sapphire \n- 50 Meters / 150 Feet Water Resistant\n- 33mm x 35mm = 1 1/4\" x 1 3/8 Case \n- 7\" Adjustable Bracelet \n- Deployment Buckle \n - Free Bracelet Sizing \n- Free Lifetime Battery Replacement   Also Known As Women's Model # 06P000171 / 6P171  \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557263,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":872554,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Michele Serein Mid Watch MWW21B000009\" \"Shop Michele MWW21B000017 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This hand-crafted watch, model number MWW21B000009 from Michele gives beauty and high tech functionality for watch lovers. This Ladies timepiece only hints at the fine watchmaking within this timepiece. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the timepiece of insurmountable functionality and exquisite style. A white dial provides an elegant contrast to the bold and captivating numbers. Its quartz (battery) movement is as intricately crafted as the exterior. This watch includes central 60 second hand, date complications. Its complications are representative of this jeweler’s unique expertise of watches that take advantage of all of the space in the dial. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The clean round case is 36 mm. The case is artfully crafted of stainless steel, both attention grabbing and is crafted to last. The watch’s stainless steel band is smooth and made out of the highest quality materials. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be found on your wrist. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 150 ft (50 meter) water resistance. The true highlight of this piece is the diamonds that are located in the dial of this watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has a stunning selection of watches from the best watchmakers in the world. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":135,"row":{"pair_id":"3430874#17557303","label":1,"id_left":3430874,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":874058,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Slim Auto Watch H38615735\"","description_left":"\"\n                             A trendy watch is more than just used for for telling time, it is also a remarkable piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H38615735 watch is from the ever popular Slim Auto collection. It features a accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 100 ft (30 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. \n Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This fine timepiece is an incredible way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is thrilled to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can exquisite timepieces are built to last and will be loved for years to come.                         \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557303,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":874058,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Slim Auto Watch H38615735\" H38615555 \"","description_right":" so you can all our watches are 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces built to last and will be loved for years come. \" A stylish watch is not just useful telling time it also a enduring piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H38615555 comes from the skillfully crafted Slim Auto collection. It features accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits this that water resistant up 100 ft (30 meter) includes Scratch sapphire crystal. with generous 2 international warranty. Are looking an exceptional gift? fashionable timepiece spectacular way commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers privileged authorized retailer","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":136,"row":{"pair_id":"4960130#7272784","label":0,"id_left":4960130,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":8380584,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Suunto M2 - Black\"@en \" Suunto Accessories Black \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Monitor your heart rate and calories easily with the M2 watch, equipped with essential tools for reaching all of your fitness goals.Features Include:Real-time heart rate calories and training guidance.Automatically switches between three heart rate zones.Menu in nine different languages.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7272784,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":9006964,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Suunto Ambit 3 Sports with HR - Black\"@en \" Suunto Heart Rate Accessories Black \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Keep track of your heart rate and running performance while you work out with this multisport watch for a personalised experience. Use with the free Suunto Movescount App to plan your workouts and get voice guidance during your workout. You can also adjust the watch on the go and share your experience with others. Features Include:15h battery life with 5-sec GPS accuracy.Speed pace distance and GPS altitude.Route navigation and track back.Compass.Heart rate in swimming.Bike power support (Bluetooth Smart).Multiple sports in one log.Interval workout planner.Interval workouts with voice guidance.Activity based recovery time.Quick recovery and sleep recovery tests (Firstbeat).Movescount training programs on watch.Extended feature set through Suunto Apps.Languages: EN CS DA DE ES FI FR IT JA KO NL NO PL PT RU SV ZH.\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":137,"row":{"pair_id":"14869929#7651326","label":1,"id_left":14869929,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":81467,"brand_left":"\"Casio\"@de","title_left":" \"G-Shock Herrenuhr\"@de \"Casio G-Shock Herrenuhr GA-110GB-1AER nur 149 00 €\"@de","description_left":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 4238 GA-110GB-1AER\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tSportlicher Herrenchronograph der Marke Casio.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuto LED LightUm das Display der Uhr durch Leuchtdioden erstrahlen zu lassen, genügt eine leichte Drehung des Handgelenks\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tStoßfest\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAntimagnetischDas Gehäuse ist so konstruiert, dass es vor Magnetfeldern abgeschirmt ist.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tWeltzeit FunktionDie Weltzeit Funktion zeigt die Uhrzeiten in bis zu 29 verschiedenen ZeitzonenEs gibt insgesamt 24 Zeitzonen, die je 15 Längengrade umfassen und beim Nullmeridian beginnen. Beim Übergang von einer zur folgenden Zeitzone verschiebt sich die Zeit um eine Stunde. Je nach Himmelsrichtung verschiebt sich die Zeit entweder eine Stunde nach hinten ( Westen) oder nach vorne (Osten).\nDie wichtigsten internationalen Zeitsignale sind: DCF77 (Deutschland) in Mainflingen in Hessen, MSF (Großbritannien) in Anthorn, JJY (Japan), WWV (USA) in Fort Collins, WWVH (USA) auf Hawaii, BPC (China) in Shangqiu\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon an.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tStoppfunktion - 1/1000 Sek. - 100 Std. - Split\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tTimer - 1/1 Min. - 24 Std. (mit aut. Wiederholfunktion)\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t5 Tagesalarme\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tSchlummerfunktion: Nachdem Sie das Alarmsignal stoppen, ertönt es nach einigen Minuten automatisch wieder.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAutomatischer KalenderEinmal eingestellt zeigt der automatische Kalender immer das richtige Datum an.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t12-/24-Stunden-Format\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tResin-ArmbandResin besteht aus Naturharz und ist durch seine extreme Haltbarkeit und seine Flexibilität das ideale Material für Armbänder.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tCa. 2 Jahre lang versorgt die Batterie die Uhr mit der nötigen Energie.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7651326,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":81467,"brand_right":"\"Casio\"","title_right":" \"Casio GA-110GB-1AER G-Shock watch\"","description_right":"\"            \t                    This beautiful sports Casio G-shock watch features a plastic case fitted with a Plastic /silicone based strap. Besides that this watch is a very nice piece of jewelry on your arm, it also still has very useful features, like alarm, chronograph. These trendy watches have all the features in it for the sports person. Performed in many different colors and digital functions it can be used for each sport.  2 year guarantee on the movement. Comes in luxury brandbox.            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":138,"row":{"pair_id":"7951776#8014072","label":0,"id_left":7951776,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":81985,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Mens Casio G-Shock Premium Gulfmaster Alarm Chronograph Radio Controlled Watch GWN-1000B-1BER\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Brand Casio Case Width 45 Case Depth 15 Model Name G-Shock Premium Gulfmaster MPN GWN-1000B-1BER EAN 4971850999355 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Stainless Steel and Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Strap colour Black Warranty 2 years Brand Casio Case Width 45 Case Depth 15 Model Name G-Shock Premium Gulfmaster MPN GWN-1000B-1BER EAN 4971850999355 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Stainless Steel and Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Strap colour Black Warranty 2 years","id_right":8014072,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":388422,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Mens Casio G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass Alarm Chronograph Radio Controlled Watch GWG-1000-1A3ER\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Brand Casio Case Width 51 Case Depth 15 Model Name G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass MPN GWG-1000-1A3ER EAN 4971850028345 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Stainless Steel and Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Hour Markers Batons Strap colour Khaki Warranty 2 years Brand Casio Case Width 51 Case Depth 15 Model Name G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass MPN GWG-1000-1A3ER EAN 4971850028345 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Stainless Steel and Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Hour Markers Batons Strap colour Khaki Warranty 2 years"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":139,"row":{"pair_id":"492749#5775498","label":1,"id_left":492749,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":637661,"brand_left":"\"Seiko\"@de","title_left":" \"Prospex Diver´s Revival Automatikuhr\"@de 00 €\"@de \"Seiko Prospex Automatikuhr SRP773K1 nur 439","description_left":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 1319 SRP773K1\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tModisch-elegante Herren-AutomatikuhrDie Automatikuhr ist eine mechanische Armbanduhr, bei der die Feder bei Armbewegungen des Trägers durch einen Rotor in kleinen Schritten aufgezogen wird.\nDer Rotor, der zumeist kugelgelagert ist, bleibt bei Bewegungen des Uhrgehäuses aufgrund seiner Massenträgheit und der Schwerkraft im Raum stehen, wobei ein Drehmoment auf den Aufziehmechanismus ausgeübt wird. Im Normalfall wird die Feder in beide Drehrichtungen aufgezogen. Liegt die Drehbewegung des Gehäuses in der Achse des Rotors, so beruht das Prinzip allein auf dem Trägheitsmoment des Rotors. Dieses Phänomen funktioniert also auch in der Schwerelosigkeit. Bei Drehbewegungen, die senkrecht zur Achse des Rotors stattfinden, kommt die Exzentrizität desselben zum Tragen: Der Rotor ist zumeist nur halbkreisförmig ausgebildet, so dass sein Schwerpunkt nicht mit seiner Achse zusammenfällt. Wird die Uhr nur leicht aus der Horizontalen gedreht, genügt dies gegebenenfalls für eine 180-Grad-Drehung des Rotors. Eine Rutschkupplung verhindert ein Überdrehen der Zugfeder, wenn die Uhr bereits voll aufgezogen ist. Automatikuhren zeichnen sich neben ihrer einfachen Handhabung auch durch einen erheblich gleichmäßigeren Lauf aus, der durch die stets gleichmäßig gespannte Feder ausgelöst wird.  Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon der Marke Seiko.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse ist aus hochwertigem Edelstahl gefertigt und hat eine fein gebürstete Oberfläche.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem dunkelblauen Zifferblatt befindet sich ein \"Seiko Automatik Diver´s\" Schriftzug.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie silberfarbenen Zeiger und IndizesIndizes ist das deutsche Wort für das lateinische Index. Spricht man von Indizes, dann sind die Zahlen die die Zeit anzeigen (bei vielen Uhren z.B. arabische Zahlen: 3, 6, 9, 12, aber auch z.B. römische Zahlen: III, VI, IX, XII) oder stattdessen die Platzhalter dafür gemeint. Platzhalter können je nach Gestaltung der Uhr die Unterschiedlichsten Formen haben. Uhrenindexe werden oft nicht nur aufgemalt sondern auch aufgesetzt – bei exklusiven Uhren auch veredelt (mit z.B. Gold, Rosegold, Silber, Chrom). Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon sind mit einer Leuchtmasse (LumiBrite) gefüllt, damit auch im Dunkeln die Uhrzeit gut lesbar ist.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf der 3-Uhr Position befindet sich eine Datums- und Wochentagsanzeige.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDer Zifferblattrand ist mit einer vollständigen MinuterieAuf dem Zifferblatt umlaufende Einteilung der Minuten, oft zwischen zwei Kreise eingefaßt (‘Eisenbahnminuterie = sieht aus wie Eisenbahnschienen) und teilweise mit ‘5’-Minutenzahlen versehen. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon versehen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr wird durch ein spezielles Hardlexglas vor äußeren Einflüssen geschützt.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie drehbare, blaue Lünette ist mit einer Minutenskalierung versehen. Die Oberfläche ist mit einer TitankarbidauflageTitan (Ti) ist ein chemisches Element und wird zu den Übergangsmetallen gezählt. Titan zeichnet sich durch besondere Festigkeit ,Korrosions- und temperaturbeständigkeit bei geringem Gewicht aus und ist daher für die Verarbeitung in Uhrengehäusen und -bändern besonders geeignet.\nDa Titan in reiner Form praktisch nicht vorkommt, wird es aus Titanverbindungen, z.B. dem Titaneisenerz (Ilmenit) oder dem Titandioxid (Rutil) hergestellt. Da dieser Prozess sehr aufwändig ist, kostet Titan etwa das Zehnfache im Vergleich zu Stahl. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon beschichtet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr wird durch ein Kaliber 4R36 Werk angetrieben. Das Automatikwerk besteht aus 169 Werkteilen und 24 LagersteinenDas Lager einer Uhr sind kleine Bohrungen für die Zapfen des Räderwerks. In manchen Fällen werden die Bohrungen für schnell drehende Triebe und Räder mit Lagersteinen verstärkt. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Gangreserve\nAls Gangreserve bezeichnet man den Zeitraum, in dem eine Uhr läuft ohne aufgezogen werden zu müssen. Die Gangreserveanzeige beschreibt die verbleibende Zeit bis zum Stillstand einer mechanischen Uhr und gibt so Auskunft, wann eine Uhr erneut aufgezogen werden sollte.\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon beträgt 41 Stunden.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr verfügt über eine beidseitige, automatische HandaufzugmHandaufzug ist die manuelle Form eine Uhr zum Laufen zu bringen. Dabei wird die Aufzugskrone von Hand gespannt und sorgt so für eine Gangreserve von 38-40 Stunden. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikonöglichkeit.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tZudem sind der Gehäuseboden und die Krone verschraubt.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tBis zu einem Wasserdruck von 20 bar ist die Uhr wasserdicht.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse hat einen Durchmesser von ca. 44.3 mm, die Höhe beträgt ca. 13.00 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas drei-reihige Band ist aus Edelstahl gefertigt und verspricht einen hohen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tVerschlossen wird das Band mit einer Sicherheitsfaltschließe.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tInformationen zu AutomatikuhrenWas sind eigentlich Automatikuhren?Automatikuhren sind Uhren, welche ein mechanisches Uhrwerk aufweisen und von einem Rotor angetrieben werden. Dieser wird  durch Bewegungen vom Arm bzw. Handgelenk  zum Rotieren gebracht  um die Hauptantriebsfeder aufzuziehen.  Aufgrund dessen wird laufend Energie hergestellt, so dass eine Batterie überflüssig wird. Die Gangabweichungen einer Uhr variieren je nach Fertigung, Kalibrierung beim Hersteller, Lebensstil, sowie Tragegewohnheit des Trägers. Die meisten Automatikuhren haben eine Gangabweichung von -20/+30 Sekunden am Tag.  Dies muss leider akzeptiert werden. Sofern eine höhere Ganggenauigkeit gewünscht ist, sind Uhren mit Chronometerprüfung  eine gute Wahl.  Hier erhalten die Uhren das Bewertungszertifikat COSC, für welches sie im Vorfeld diverse Tests bestehen müssen – erst dann dürfen sie sich als Chronometer bezeichnen. Die Ganggenauigkeit darf maximal -4/+6 Sekunden Abweichung am Tag aufweisen und ist ca. 20 Mal genauer als eine normale Automatikuhr. Um der Ganggenauigkeit positiv entgegen zu wirken spielen die Tragegewohnheiten des Trägers eine große Rolle, denn ein aktiver Uhrenträger kann sich über eine genauere Uhr freuen als ein „passiver“ Uhrenträger.Neben der Ganggenauigkeit spielt auch die Gangreserve eine zentrale Rolle bei Automatikuhren. Die Gangreserve, auch Gangautonomie genannt, bezeichnet die Zeitdauer, in der das Uhrwerk weiterläuft, nachdem sie das letzte Mal bewegt wurde. Hier variiert die Stundenanzahl sehr stark und liegt je nach Uhr zwischen 32 und 60 Stunden.Die Langlebigkeit einer Automatikuhr  kann durch das Verhindern von starken Temperaturschwankungen, unnötigen Stößen, Luftdruckschwankungen und Wasserdruck, sowie das häufige Tragen einer Uhr erheblich verbessert werden. Dies wirkt sich auf alle Teile, insbesondere auf das Uhrwerk, sehr positiv aus.Ein großer Vorteil von Automatikuhren ist, dass sie ohne Batterien auskommen. Des Weiteren entfällt das manuelle Aufziehen der Triebfeder. Somit wird eine lange Haltbarkeit einer Automatikuhr gewährleistet. Das Uhrwerk sollte nach 2-5 Jahren ggf. überholt werden, um die Haltbarkeit weiter sicherzustellen.Zu guter Letzt ist es wichtig zu wissen,  wo der Unterschied zwischen Quarz- und Automatikuhren liegt. Quarzuhren sind im Handel in analoger und digitaler Ausführung erhältlich.  Sie sind elektromechanische oder auch vollelektronische Uhren deren Taktgeber ein elektronischer Oszillator ist. Daher ziehen sie ihre Energie meist aus einer Batterie oder aus Knopfzellen. Einige wenige Ausnahmen gibt es, in denen mechanische Energie über einen Mechanismus  in elektrische Ladung umgewandelt und in Akkus gespeichert wird. Dies ist beispielsweise bei der Linie Seiko Kinetic der Fall. Quarzuhren werden meist als Echtzeituhren bezeichnet. Hieraus lässt sich schließen, dass eine Quarzuhr im Gegensatz zu einer Automatikuhr hinsichtlich der Genauigkeit ganz klar die Nase vorn hat und ohne Bewegung der Uhr absolute Genauigkeit aufweist.Automatikuhren sind besonders interessant für Uhrenkenner. Einen Blickfang stellt der flüssig laufende Sekundenzeiger dar. Häufig sind die Uhren mit einem Glasboden versehen, der einen Blick auf das Uhrwerk und den sich bewegenden Rotor zulässt. Die Faszination der Mechanik einer Uhr liegt ganz klar bei Automatikuhr en!\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5775498,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":637661,"brand_right":"\"Seiko\"@en","title_right":" \"Prospex Diver´s Revival Automatic Watch\"@en \"Seiko Prospex Watch SRP773K1 nur € 439.00\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":140,"row":{"pair_id":"4105663#12576982","label":0,"id_left":4105663,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":142233,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Junghans Men's Max Bill Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/4002.44) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Iconic design, true to the original penned by Max Bill in the 1960's, the Junghans Max Bill Chronoscope is elegant and refined, as well as perfectly simple. Inside the watch is a Junghans self winding automatic mechanical J800.1 movement, with the bare necessities of second, minute and hour, plus date window at 3 o'clock. This is displayed on a matte silver plated dial, beautifully curved, with hour and minutes marked clearly and simply with very slim batons, and luminous markers at the 4 quarters. The case is a stainless steel construction, with curved SICRALAN coated hard plexiglass, true to the original. The watch fastens on a fine milanese mesh steel bracelet with safety clasp.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12576982,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1002385,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Ladies Accurist Watch LB1791 \"Sale | The Hut\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":141,"row":{"pair_id":"12575300#10569015","label":0,"id_left":12575300,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1401382,"brand_left":"\"Tag Heuer\"","title_left":" \"Tag Heuer Carrera CAR2A1Z.FT6044\" CAR2A1Z.FT6044 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            In both name and spirit, the Calibre 01 represents the first of what is expected to become a series of modernised upgrades for TAG Heuer timepieces masterminded by legend of the watchmaking world, Jean-Claude Biver. This model sees the familiar and iconic shape of the Carrera enhanced with an avant-garde (and larger) case build and a striking skeletonised dial. The 45mm titanium-carbide coated case is modular in design, constructed entirely in-house. The same goes for the movement (a modified version of the brand's superb Cal. 1887), which together with the skeletonisation and the red highlights creates a hi-tech aesthetic that builds on the watch's historical race car legacy.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Tag Heuer has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Tag Heuer certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10569015,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":3141974,"brand_right":"\"Omega\"","title_right":" \"Omega Speedmaster Moonwatch 311.92.44.51.01.004\" 311.92.44.51.01.004 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Omega has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Omega certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":142,"row":{"pair_id":"4105663#7844178","label":0,"id_left":4105663,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":142233,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Junghans Men's Max Bill Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/4002.44) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Iconic design, true to the original penned by Max Bill in the 1960's, the Junghans Max Bill Chronoscope is elegant and refined, as well as perfectly simple. Inside the watch is a Junghans self winding automatic mechanical J800.1 movement, with the bare necessities of second, minute and hour, plus date window at 3 o'clock. This is displayed on a matte silver plated dial, beautifully curved, with hour and minutes marked clearly and simply with very slim batons, and luminous markers at the 4 quarters. The case is a stainless steel construction, with curved SICRALAN coated hard plexiglass, true to the original. The watch fastens on a fine milanese mesh steel bracelet with safety clasp.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7844178,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1642088,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Ladies Karl Lagerfeld Joleigh Watch KL3409 \"Ladies Watches | Designer For Women The Hut\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":143,"row":{"pair_id":"11988485#8309629","label":0,"id_left":11988485,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":275665,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Nixon Unisex The Time Teller Chrono Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Unisex Watch (A972-2348) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This attractive unisex Nixon The Time Teller Chrono watch has a stainless steel case and is fitted with a chronograph quartz movement. It is fastened with a silver metal  bracelet and has a black dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8309629,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":342354,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Folli Follie Ladies' Day Dream Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (6015.1508) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This attractive ladies Folli Follie Day Dream watch has a stainless steel case and is fitted with a quartz movement. It fastens a silver metal  bracelet and has a silver dial.  The watch also has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":144,"row":{"pair_id":"16669971#12615941","label":0,"id_left":16669971,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":3559175,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"TomTom Spark 3 HR (Large) - Black\"@en \" TomTom Cardio Black Accessories 1RK0.002.00 \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Mix up your training and track different sports with the dedicated multisport mode. Get real-time stats on the go, including time, distance, speed and pace, thanks to the 24/7 activity tracking and inbuilt GPS tracker. The TomTom Spark 3 Cardio also monitors you heart rate, step count and sleep. With its water resistant design, up to 40m, you can wear it during outdoor activities such as running or cycling in the rain and even track your swimming.Explore new areas without the worry of getting lost, thanks to the route exploration feature, which displays your trail and allows you to easily navigate your way back home. With a wireless syncing feature, you can sync, share and study your activity data with your favourite workout apps like Strava, Runkeeper, MapMyFitness, NikePlus or Endomondo. To get the best and most secure fit, it is recommended that you measure your wrist before purchasing the TomTom Spark 3 Cardio. This watch is suitable for wrist sizes between 143-206mm.Features Include:24/7 activity trackingGPS trackingMultisport modeRoute explorationBuilt-in heart rate monitorIndoor training modeWireless syncingCustomisable strapsWater resistantLong battery life - up to 10 hours of battery lifetime when tracking with GPSDisplay size: 22 x 25 mmWrist size: 143-206 mm\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12615941,"category_right":"not found","cluster_id_right":1553627,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Spark Fit - (Large) Black\"@en \" TomTom Black Accessories 1RE0.002.01 \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Track your way to a fitter, healthier you with the TomTom Spark Fit Cardio Fitness Watch. With 24/7 GPS activity tracking, the watch will capture everything you need to know about your lifestyle and exercise routine, including time, distance, calories burned and steps taken.Whether you’re playing tennis or going for a run, hitting the gym or going for a swim, you can take your workout one step further by setting yourself daily or weekly goals. Features Include:Tracks calories burned distance travelled pace speed steps taken and hours sleptWater-resistant design protects the watch in water or while you run in the rainWireless syncingFits large wrist sizesMultisport mode lets you track run bike swim gym and treadmill modesUltra-Slim designGoal setting to monitor daily and weekly goals\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":145,"row":{"pair_id":"15544838#677","label":0,"id_left":15544838,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":4968146,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Must 21 W10125U2\" W10125U2 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            Cartier has been in business ever since Louis-François Cartier took over the Paris workshop of his mentor Adolphe Picard in 1847. Since then, the name Cartier has become synonymous with quality, luxury and grace. Known as one of the foremost purveyors of ultra-elegant jewellery, Cartier has long made superb watches as well—many with excellent mechanical pedigree. The company's glamorous reputation is justified by every model, crafted with a unique and unrivalled stylishness that continues to make it one of the most highly sought brands in the world. The superb Must 21 series is no exception, as seen in this model's stunning oversized bezel an dial patterned with the Cartier logo.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £225.63 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £112.81 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £62.15 £1,942.85 £137.85 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £43.35 £2,011.85 £206.85 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £34.01 £2,083.73 £278.73 9.9%","id_right":677,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":6811132,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Link and Round Diamond Ring \"@en \"Link | Shane Co.\"@en","description_right":"\"\nThis entwined design features 18 round diamonds, at approximately .07 carat total weight. Each diamond has been hand-selected for exceptional brilliance. The ring is crafted from quality 14 karat white gold. Add the center stone of your choice to complete this amazing look.\nItem Number: 41048923\n\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":146,"row":{"pair_id":"14649025#8992332","label":1,"id_left":14649025,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":189515,"brand_left":"\"TAG Heuer\"@de","title_left":" \" TAG HEUER CARRERA Calibre 5 Day-Date Automatikuhr 100 M - ∅41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 \"@de \"TAG Heuer Carrera Automatic Watch 41 | watch price\"@de","description_left":"\" Discover the TAG Heuer Carrera Calibre 5 Day-Date Automatic Watch 41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 Die Carrera Calibre 5-Reihe mit einem Modell mit Wochentags- und Datumsfenster – für Menschen, die Stil zu schätzen wissen..\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8992332,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":189515,"brand_right":"\"TAG Heuer\"@pt","title_right":" \" TAG HEUER CARRERA Calibre 5 Day-Date Relógio Automático 100 M - ∅41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 \"@pt \"TAG Heuer Carrera Automatic Watch 41 | watch price\"@pt","description_right":"\" Discover the TAG Heuer Carrera Calibre 5 Day-Date Automatic Watch 41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 Para as pessoas que realmente valorizam o estilo, um modelo Day-Date  se une à coleção Carrera Calibre 5..\"@pt ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":147,"row":{"pair_id":"16801286#12449454","label":0,"id_left":16801286,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":373267,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Casio Men's G-Shock Rangeman Alarm Chronograph Radio Controlled Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (GW-9400-1ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"An oversized design from G-Shock by Casio. This Rangerman edition has a large 53mm case and LCD dial. This watch is jam packed with features such as Super-Full-Auto-LED light, Shock resistant, Solar Power, Radio signal reception (EU, USA, Japan, China),  Barometer (260 / 1.100 hPa), Thermometer (-10�C / +60�C), Digital-compass, 10,000 m Altimeter, Sunrise/sunset display, Altimeter data memory, World time function, Stopwatch function - 1/100 sec - 1.000 hours, Timer - 1/1 min. - 24 hours, 5 daily alarms, Snooze feature, Button tones on/off, Automatic calendar, 12/24-hour timekeeping, Mineral glass, Resin case, Resin band, Battery level indicator and Water resistance classification (20 bar). \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12449454,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":492729,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Casio Unisex Classic Collection Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Unisex Watch (LA670WEGB-1BEF) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This unisex Casio Classic Collection watch is made from gold plated and is fitted with a chronograph quartz movement. It is fastened with a black metal  bracelet and has a LCD dial.  The watch has a date function.  Includes alarm function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":148,"row":{"pair_id":"10760238#10671044","label":0,"id_left":10760238,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15145,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Garmin Forerunner 235 - Black Frost Blue\"@en \" Garmin Running Accessories & Blue \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Take the next step as a runner with this easy to use GPS watch that lets you track how far, how fast and how long you’re running. Instantly share your runs and tracking progress with friends, family and the world via social media by pairing a compatible device with Garmin Connect™ Network. Activity tracking counts steps and calories and reminds you when it’s time to move, while heart rate compatibility allows you to train with heart rate zones so you know when to push it on that last mile or when to reign it in.  Forerunner 235 is also compatible with GPS and GLONASS satellites which track your location, whether you are running out in the sticks or in the city.You can also receive weather forecasts and conditions via the app's wireless connectivity.Features Include:Connected features²: automatic uploads to Garmin Connect™ live tracking audio prompts music controls smart notifications and social media sharing.Tracks pace distance time heart rate¹ and more.Activity tracking³ counts calories distance daily steps and sleep.Download data fields watch faces widgets and applications from Connect IQ™\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10671044,"category_right":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":54711,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Touch Activity Tracker (Large) - Black\"@en-GB \" TomTom Black Accessories 1AT0.001.00 \"@en-GB","description_right":"\"\n                                    Why track your steps when you can track what your body is made of? TomTom Touch makes other trackers old news because as well as tracking steps, sleep and heart rate, it tracks your body composition. Whether you want to be stronger, fitter, leaner or just want to know, track what you're made of, not just your steps.\n\nMeasure body fat and muscle\n\nMeasure your body fat and muscle percentage from your wrist at the touch of a button. The TomTom Touch will let you know how your body composition changes over time to help you understand your fitness level and whether your fitness routine is helping you to achieve your goals.\n\nMonitor your heart rate\n\nMonitor your heart rate throughout the day and find out your resting heart rate, which is a great indicator of your fitness level.\n\nSee how many steps you've taken\n\nWith 24/7 tracking for daily activities you can monitor how many steps you take throughout the day, how long you're active for, calories burned and sleep time. TomTom Touc\n                                    \n                                \"@en-GB ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":149,"row":{"pair_id":"15398300#980489","label":0,"id_left":15398300,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":607687,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Tissot Quickster T095.417.17.037.01 Chrono\"@en \"Watch Tissot T-Sport Laguardajoiers official dealer of in Barcelona\"@en catalog","description_left":"\" Tissot T-Sport Quickster T0954171703701. Tissot Watches Quickster, see current catalog price. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":980489,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":36950,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Unisex M200 Bluetooth GPS Activity Tracker Heart Rate Monitor Alarm Chronograph Watch \"@de \"GPS Uhren | Official Stockist for Uhren\"@de","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":150,"row":{"pair_id":"10760238#16706345","label":1,"id_left":10760238,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15145,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Garmin Forerunner 235 - Black Frost Blue\"@en \" Garmin Running Accessories & Blue \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Take the next step as a runner with this easy to use GPS watch that lets you track how far, how fast and how long you’re running. Instantly share your runs and tracking progress with friends, family and the world via social media by pairing a compatible device with Garmin Connect™ Network. Activity tracking counts steps and calories and reminds you when it’s time to move, while heart rate compatibility allows you to train with heart rate zones so you know when to push it on that last mile or when to reign it in.  Forerunner 235 is also compatible with GPS and GLONASS satellites which track your location, whether you are running out in the sticks or in the city.You can also receive weather forecasts and conditions via the app's wireless connectivity.Features Include:Connected features²: automatic uploads to Garmin Connect™ live tracking audio prompts music controls smart notifications and social media sharing.Tracks pace distance time heart rate¹ and more.Activity tracking³ counts calories distance daily steps and sleep.Download data fields watch faces widgets and applications from Connect IQ™\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":16706345,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15145,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Unisex Forerunner 235 HR GPS Bluetooth Alarm Chronograph Watch \"@de \"Damen-Sportuhren\"@de","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":151,"row":{"pair_id":"17524639#9707032","label":0,"id_left":17524639,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":109665,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Casio Ladies' Baby-G Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (BLX-100-7ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This stunning ladies Casio Baby-g watch has a stainless steel and resin stainless steel and resin case and is powered by a chronograph quartz movement. It is fitted with a white rubber strap and has a LCD dial.  The watch has a date function.  Includes alarm function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9707032,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":120405,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Casio Men's G-Shock Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (GA-100-1A1ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"High-impact mens Casio X-Large G-Shock model in stealth black resin with black detailing, with white hour hand detailing. Features include chronograph, 5 daily alarms, countdown timer, world time from a Japanese Quartz movement with perpetual calendar and date function, LED backlight and digital tachymeter. The watch fastens with a sturdy rubber strap with double tang buckle for extra security. Impressively sized at 55mm and built as tough as possible, with 20 bar water resistance and the signature G-Shock design.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":152,"row":{"pair_id":"17557408#17557272","label":0,"id_left":17557408,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":12350136,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Regulator Auto Watch H42615553\" \"Shop Hamilton Collection at Safa Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p> A fine watch is more than just useful for telling time, it is also a incredible piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H42615553 watch hails from the skillfully crafted Regulator collection. It features a accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 150 ft (50 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. </p>\n<p> Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This stylish timepiece is an incredible way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is thrilled to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can be sure timepieces are built to endure and will be enjoyed for years to come. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557272,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":854223,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Seaview Day Date Auto Watch H37565131\" \"Shop Hamilton Collection at Safa Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A trendy watch is not just useful for telling time, it is also a remarkable piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H37565131 watch comes from the ever popular Seaview Day Date Auto collection. It features a accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 330 ft (100 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. </p>\n<p> Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This fine timepiece is a thoughtful way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is thrilled to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can  all our watches are 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces are designed to endure and will be enjoyed for years to come. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":153,"row":{"pair_id":"2525869#5362791","label":0,"id_left":2525869,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":998132,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Mens Coach Bleecker Slim Watch 14602343 \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men The Hut\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5362791,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":991183,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Mens Superdry Watch SYG190T \"Men's Watches | Designer For Men The Hut\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":154,"row":{"pair_id":"9169175#10872399","label":0,"id_left":9169175,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":4968146,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Must 21 W10125U2\" W10125U2 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            Cartier has been in business ever since Louis-François Cartier took over the Paris workshop of his mentor Adolphe Picard in 1847. Since then, the name Cartier has become synonymous with quality, luxury and grace. Known as one of the foremost purveyors of ultra-elegant jewellery, Cartier has long made superb watches as well—many with excellent mechanical pedigree. The company's glamorous reputation is justified by every model, crafted with a unique and unrivalled stylishness that continues to make it one of the most highly sought brands in the world. The superb Must 21 series is no exception, as seen in this model's stunning oversized bezel an dial patterned with the Cartier logo.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £225.63 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £112.81 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £62.15 £1,942.85 £137.85 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £43.35 £2,011.85 £206.85 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £34.01 £2,083.73 £278.73 9.9%","id_right":10872399,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":3893035,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Roadster W62004V3\" W62004V3 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":155,"row":{"pair_id":"4118692#4891751","label":0,"id_left":4118692,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":12727,"brand_left":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@de","title_left":" \"Classic Black Bristol Silver 40mm\"@de \"Daniel Wellington Classic 40mm nur 189 00 €\"@de","description_left":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 1621 DW00100131\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tElegant-moderne Herrenuhr der Marke Daniel Wellington.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Oberfläche ist poliert und hat eine silberfarbene IP Beschichtung.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tGehäuse, Zeiger und IndizesIndizes ist das deutsche Wort für das lateinische Index. Spricht man von Indizes, dann sind die Zahlen die die Zeit anzeigen (bei vielen Uhren z.B. arabische Zahlen: 3, 6, 9, 12, aber auch z.B. römische Zahlen: III, VI, IX, XII) oder stattdessen die Platzhalter dafür gemeint. Platzhalter können je nach Gestaltung der Uhr die Unterschiedlichsten Formen haben. Uhrenindexe werden oft nicht nur aufgemalt sondern auch aufgesetzt – bei exklusiven Uhren auch veredelt (mit z.B. Gold, Rosegold, Silber, Chrom). Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon sind aus hochwertigen Edelstahl hergestellt und silbern beschichtet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem schlichten, schwarzen Zifferblatt befindet sich ein Daniel Wellington Schriftzug mit Logo.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Mineralglas schützt die Uhr vor äußeren Einflüssen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDer Gehäusedurchmesser beträgt ca. 40 mm und hat eine Höhe von ca. 6 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas hochwertige Lederarmband gewährt einen angenehmen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Band wird mit einer DornschließeEine Dornschließe beschreibt die Verschlussart einer Uhr.  In dem längeren Armbandteil werden löcher gestanzt. Auf der anderen Seite befindet sich die Dornschließe, welche aus einem Dorn und einem Metallbügel in U-Form, diese verhindert, dass der Dorn aus dem Loch rutscht.\nDornschließen sind an diversen Materialien zu finden und erstrecken sich in alle Preisklasse. Häufig findet man Dornschließen bei Lederarmbändern oder Textilarmbändern.\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon, auf welcher zusätzlich das Logo graviert ist, verschlossen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":4891751,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":563062,"brand_right":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@de","title_right":" \"Bristol Silver Damenuhr 36mm\"@de \"Daniel Wellington Bristol 36mm nur 169 00 €\"@de","description_right":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 1699 DW00100056\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tElegant-moderne Damenuhr der Marke Daniel Wellington.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Oberfläche ist poliert und hat eine silberne IP Beschichtung.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tGehäuse, Zeiger und IndizesIndizes ist das deutsche Wort für das lateinische Index. Spricht man von Indizes, dann sind die Zahlen die die Zeit anzeigen (bei vielen Uhren z.B. arabische Zahlen: 3, 6, 9, 12, aber auch z.B. römische Zahlen: III, VI, IX, XII) oder stattdessen die Platzhalter dafür gemeint. Platzhalter können je nach Gestaltung der Uhr die Unterschiedlichsten Formen haben. Uhrenindexe werden oft nicht nur aufgemalt sondern auch aufgesetzt – bei exklusiven Uhren auch veredelt (mit z.B. Gold, Rosegold, Silber, Chrom). Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon sind aus hochwertigen Edelstahl hergestellt und silbern beschichtet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem Zifferblatt befindet sich ein Daniel Wellington Schriftzug mit Logo.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Mineralglas schützt die Uhr vor äußeren Einflüssen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDer Gehäusedurchmesser beträgt ca. 36 mm und hat eine Höhe von ca. 6 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas hochwertige Lederarmband gewährt einen angenehmen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Band wird mit einer DornschließeEine Dornschließe beschreibt die Verschlussart einer Uhr.  In dem längeren Armbandteil werden löcher gestanzt. Auf der anderen Seite befindet sich die Dornschließe, welche aus einem Dorn und einem Metallbügel in U-Form, diese verhindert, dass der Dorn aus dem Loch rutscht.\nDornschließen sind an diversen Materialien zu finden und erstrecken sich in alle Preisklasse. Häufig findet man Dornschließen bei Lederarmbändern oder Textilarmbändern.\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon, auf welcher zusätzlich das Logo graviert ist, verschlossen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":156,"row":{"pair_id":"16890726#5358743","label":0,"id_left":16890726,"category_left":"not found","cluster_id_left":1588634,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio+Music DBL/LBL (Large) - Sky Captain Blue/Scuba Blue\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Blue \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, track your heart rate and capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Cardio + music.Store and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. Track your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor.A goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.Compatible with a wide range of Bluetooth headphones (available seperately) so you can listen without wires.Wireless syncing to your favourite apps such as TomTom MySports Strava Runkeeper Up Nike+ etc.QuickGPSFix technology finds your location quickly so you can start running sooner.Water resistant to 50m.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5358743,"category_right":"Other_Electronics","cluster_id_right":3688074,"brand_right":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 3 Cardio + Music GPS Sports Watch Bluetooth Headphones - Black / Green S\"@en online\"@en","description_right":"\"Run with over 500 songs and your heart rate on your wristFeatures\n\nBuilt-in Heart Rate Monitor: See your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor. No chest strap needed.*\nGPS Tracking: Time. Distance. Speed. Pace. Routes. Live stats, on the go.\nPlay over 500 songs from your watch: Over 500 Songs of Music Storage (3GB)\nMultisport Modes: Track all your sports. Run. Bike. Swim. Treadmill. Gym. Indoor cycling and more.\nRoute Exploration: Explore new routes and find your way back to the start.\nLong Battery Life: Get up to 11 hours of battery lifetime when tracking yourself with GPS\n24/7 Activity Tracking: Capture your heart rate, steps, active minutes, and calories burned throughout the day.\nRace Mode: Select one of your past performances to race against.\nInterval Training: Improve speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.\nPerfect Fit: Select large or small watch straps to ensure the perfect fit for your wrist.\nIndoor Training Mode: Track your performance on the treadmill or in the gym.\nWireless Syncing: Sync your watch wirelessly with your favourite running apps.\nWater Resistant to 40m: Get wet. Dive into the pool and run in all weather conditions.\nCustomisable Straps: Switch watch straps to fit your kit or match your mood.\nSocial sharing: Celebrate your success with friends. Share your workouts online.\nQuickGPS: Get started faster with quicker GPS reception\nUltra-Slim Design: Notice your watch only when you want to\nOne-Button Control: Navigate easily through menus with a single button.\nGoal Setting: Set and track your progress on daily and weekly goals.\nAutomatic Sleep Tracking: Track your sleep patterns and know if you're getting the sleep you need.\n5 Heart Rate Training Zones: Training in 5 different heart rate zones helps to get results faster.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":157,"row":{"pair_id":"3230904#11831773","label":0,"id_left":3230904,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":451758,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Lady Black Reading silver\"@en-GB silver 10:35 Watch boutique\"@en-GB","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" More Information Price €169.00 EAN 7350068244766 Brand Daniel Wellington Dial type Analogue Dial color Black Gender Women Case material Stainless steel Case shape Round Case diameter 36 mm Case thickness 6 mm Case color Silver Glass material Mineral glass Band material Leather Band color Black Band thickness 18 mm Warranty 2 years Water resistance 3 ATM","id_right":11831773,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":260153,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Lady Black Sheffield silver\"@en-GB silver 10:35 Watch boutique\"@en-GB","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" More Information Price €169.00 EAN 7350068244742 Brand Daniel Wellington Dial type Analogue Dial color Black Gender Women Case material Stainless steel Case shape Round Case diameter 36 mm Case thickness 6 mm Case color Silver Glass material Mineral glass Band material Leather Band color Black Band thickness 18 mm Warranty 2 years Water resistance 3 ATM"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":158,"row":{"pair_id":"9733816#5837975","label":1,"id_left":9733816,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":269997,"brand_left":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@en","title_left":" \"Sheffield Silver Ladies´ Watch 36mm\"@en \"Daniel Wellington Sheffield 36mm nur € 169.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5837975,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":269997,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Daniel Wellington Ladies' Sheffield Silver 36mm Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (DW00100053) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This slim-line ladies Daniel Wellington Sheffield Silver 36mm watch is made from stainless steel and is fitted with a quartz movement. It fastens a black leather  strap and has a white dial. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":159,"row":{"pair_id":"7680624#1352592","label":0,"id_left":7680624,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":7991496,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Longines Conquest L3.700.4.96.6\" \"Shop Longines L3.700.4.96.6 | Merry Richards Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"\n                                    Who says you can’t have functionality and style all in one piece? This timepiece from Longines is out to prove just that. The body of the watch is a Stainless steel case material. The timepiece is enclosed in a 41-mm case .  The case is Polished bezel type which gives the piece a definitive craftsmanship. The watch’s face is decked with a Blue dial that not only matches but highlights the piece, as a whole. Features such as Central 60 second hand, Chronograph, Date as added complications make this piece more functional than ordinary. Now surely your watch won’t only tell time, it will also tell of your endearing sense for fashion and functionality.\n\nMerry Richards is an authorized and trustworthy distributor of Longines’s . You can do business with us by calling at 630-516-8000. We can also be reached through this email address: scott@merryrichardsjewelers.com.                                \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":1352592,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":6747714,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Longines Conquest Watch L3.277.4.76.6\" \"Shop Longines L3.700.4.96.6 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This hand-crafted luxury watch, model number L3.277.4.76.6 from Longines offers luxury and top notch functionality for watch enthusiasts and average wearers alike. This Ladies timepiece expresses a flawless and sophisticated character. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of numerous functionality and distinct style. A silver dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. This watch includes central 60 second hand, date complications. Its complications will amaze you because of this piece’s technical precision. The numbers on this timepiece are in indexes, arabic style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The neat round case is 29 mm. The case is artfully created out of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s stainless steel band fits snugly and fashionably over your wrist. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry knows exactly what features watch lovers adore. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":160,"row":{"pair_id":"1636368#14564124","label":0,"id_left":1636368,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":126821,"brand_left":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@en","title_left":" \"Glasgow Rose Gold Ladies´ Watch 36mm\"@en \"Daniel Wellington Glasgow 36mm nur € 111.20\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14564124,"category_right