ve just what you want. Shop with confidence knowing Metals in Time is an authorized Hamilton dealer. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557354,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":505721,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Traveler GMT Auto H32625555\" \"Traveler Auto\"","description_right":"\"<p> Metals in Time Fine Jewelers is known for having an exquisite selection of handsome luxury timepieces, from the most trusted watch brands. We offer only supreme quality timepieces and we provide exceptional service to go along with it. There is nothing quite as fine as owning a finely crafted watch. It makes a striking statement and is as fashionable as it is practical. We know that timepieces come with a variety of features and functions and our knowledgeable staff will help you navigate through our inventory to find the perfect timepiece to suit your needs. </p>\n<p> This H32625555 Hamilton watch is from the exquisite Traveler GMT Auto collection. Hamilton fine timepieces are both functional and fashionable. This H32625555 Leather Gents Hamilton timepiece features a resilient Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are searching  for a sophisticated or comfortable  watch, we have just what you want. Shop with confidence knowing Metals in Time is an authorized Hamilton dealer. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":162,"row":{"pair_id":"7974973#9828206","label":1,"id_left":7974973,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":383152,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Tissot Men's PRC200 Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0554171105700) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Updated from the original PRC200, the newer version includes a slightly larger case, with more open dial. In terms of function, the watch still has the fantastic 200 metre water resistance, with screw down crown and case back, sapphire crystal, and a Swiss ETA quartz chronograph movement, with 1/10 second precision chronograph, and date. The case is solid stainless steel, with matte and polished finish, and the black dial has the iconic yellow second hand.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9828206,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":383152,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Tissot PRC 200 Quartz T055.417.11.057.00 Chrono Gent\"@es catálogo oficial Laguardajoiers distribuidor de Tissot en Barcelona\"@es \"Reloj T-Sport","description_right":"\"Reloj Tissot T-Sport PRC 200 Quartz T0554171105700 Chrono Gent,  relojes Tissot y catálogo actualizado con precios\"@es ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":163,"row":{"pair_id":"12283949#5911090","label":1,"id_left":12283949,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":409886,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Daniel Wellington Dapper Sheffield rose gold\"@en-GB gold 10:35 Watch boutique\"@en-GB","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" More Information Price €179.00 EAN 7350068242915 Brand Daniel Wellington Dial type Analogue Dial color White Gender Unisex Case material Stainless steel Case shape Round Case diameter 38 mm Case thickness 6 mm Case color Rosé gold Glass material Mineral glass Band material Leather Band color Black Band thickness 19 mm Warranty 2 years Water resistance 3 ATM","id_right":5911090,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":409886,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Daniel Wellington Men's Dapper 38mm Sheffield Rose Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DW00100084) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This men's Daniel Wellington Dapper 38mm Sheffield Rose watch has a PVD rose plating case and is fitted with a quartz movement. It fastens a black leather  strap and has a white dial.  The watch also has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":164,"row":{"pair_id":"7095862#3062867","label":0,"id_left":7095862,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":148701,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Monopoly Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A325-1219) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This ladies Nixon The Monopoly watch is made from PVD gold plated and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fitted with a gold tone metal  bracelet and has a silver dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":3062867,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":973439,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Facet 38 Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A409-1920) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This ladies Nixon The Facet 38 watch has a stainless steel case and is fitted with a quartz movement. It fastens a silver metal  bracelet and has a white dial. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":165,"row":{"pair_id":"9058708#17557263","label":0,"id_left":9058708,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":209584,"brand_left":"\"Skagen\"","title_left":" \"Skagen SKW6216 Hagen watch\"","description_left":"\"            \t                    This beautiful Skagen SKW6216 Hagen watch steals the show! This watch with its black stainless steel case is a real eye-catcher. The color of the dial is white. Additionally, this watch has a very strong mineral crystal. A Skagen watch shows that you want something different than the rest of the world and choose for design and comfort of a perfect quality watch. You receive 2 years warranty on the movement.            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557263,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":872554,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Michele Serein Mid Watch MWW21B000009\" \"Shop Michele MWW21B000017 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This hand-crafted watch, model number MWW21B000009 from Michele gives beauty and high tech functionality for watch lovers. This Ladies timepiece only hints at the fine watchmaking within this timepiece. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the timepiece of insurmountable functionality and exquisite style. A white dial provides an elegant contrast to the bold and captivating numbers. Its quartz (battery) movement is as intricately crafted as the exterior. This watch includes central 60 second hand, date complications. Its complications are representative of this jeweler’s unique expertise of watches that take advantage of all of the space in the dial. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The clean round case is 36 mm. The case is artfully crafted of stainless steel, both attention grabbing and is crafted to last. The watch’s stainless steel band is smooth and made out of the highest quality materials. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be found on your wrist. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 150 ft (50 meter) water resistance. The true highlight of this piece is the diamonds that are located in the dial of this watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has a stunning selection of watches from the best watchmakers in the world. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":166,"row":{"pair_id":"14656600#11988485","label":1,"id_left":14656600,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":275665,"brand_left":"\"Nixon\"@de","title_left":" \"The Time Teller Chrono Black Sunray\"@de 00 €\"@de \"Nixon The Sunray A9722348 nur 189","description_left":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 3137 A9722348\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tModisch-eleganter ChronographDie Bezeichnung Chronograph leitet sich aus den griechischen Begriffen chronos für „Zeit“ und grapho für „Ich schreibe“ ab und ist die Bezeichnung für eine Stoppuhr.\nErfinder des ersten Chronographen war der Franzose Rieussec im Jahre 1821. Ein Jahr später meldete er auf seine Erfindung ein Patent an. Ein Chronograph verfügt über Stunden- Minuten- und Sekundenzeiger und bietet zusätzlich einen weiteren Mechanismus, der einen meist zentral angeordneten Chronographenzeiger durch manuelle Betätigung eines Drückers aktiviert, deaktiviert und wieder in Nullstellung bringt, ohne das eigentliche Uhrwerk zu beeinflussen. Mit diesem System lassen sich Zeitspannen von einer Minute bis zu 12 Stunden messen, je nach technischer Ausstattung. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon der Marke Nixon\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse ist aus hochwertigem, massivem Edelstahl gefertigt und hat eine gebürstete Oberfläche.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem schwarzen Zifferblatt befindet sich ein Nixon Schriftzug.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Zeiger und IndizesIndizes ist das deutsche Wort für das lateinische Index. Spricht man von Indizes, dann sind die Zahlen die die Zeit anzeigen (bei vielen Uhren z.B. arabische Zahlen: 3, 6, 9, 12, aber auch z.B. römische Zahlen: III, VI, IX, XII) oder stattdessen die Platzhalter dafür gemeint. Platzhalter können je nach Gestaltung der Uhr die Unterschiedlichsten Formen haben. Uhrenindexe werden oft nicht nur aufgemalt sondern auch aufgesetzt – bei exklusiven Uhren auch veredelt (mit z.B. Gold, Rosegold, Silber, Chrom). Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon sind ebenfalls aus Edelstahl gefertigt.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie typischen Chronographenfunktionen, wie das Stoppen der Zeit, sind über die DrückerDas ist der Teil, mit dem sich eine Funktion der Uhr steuern lässt, bei Savonnettes z. B. das Öffnen des Sprungdeckels, bei Chronographen das Starten, Stoppen und Nullstellen, bei Weltzeituhren das Verstellen der Zonenzeiten. Er befindet sich meist neben der Krone am Gehäuserand.  Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon am Gehäuserand zu betätigen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr verfügt zudem über eine Datumsanzeige.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin Mineralglas schützt die Uhr vor äußeren Einflüssen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse hat einen Durchmesser von ca. 37 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin Mineralglas schützt das Zifferblatt vor äußeren Einflüssen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas 5-gliedrige Edelstahlarmband ist aus gebürsteten Edelstahlelementen gefertigt und gewährt einen angenehmen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tVerschlossen wird das Band mit einer FaltschließeDie Faltschließe ist eine Verschlussart die am häufigsten bei Metallgliederbändern verwendet wird. Durch häufiges An- und Ausziehen der Uhren kann das Leder an der Dornschließe Risse bekommen, was mit einer Faltschließe verhindert wird. Das Armband wird hierbei nicht vollständig geöffnet, sondern an Scharnieren aufgeklappt und geweitet, sodass man die Uhr problemlos vom Handgelenk bekommt. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr kann sowohl von Männern, als auch von Frauen getragen werden und ist ein stylischer Begleiter.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11988485,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":275665,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Nixon Unisex The Time Teller Chrono Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Unisex Watch (A972-2348) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This attractive unisex Nixon The Time Teller Chrono watch has a stainless steel case and is fitted with a chronograph quartz movement. It is fastened with a silver metal  bracelet and has a black dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":167,"row":{"pair_id":"5775498#12022250","label":0,"id_left":5775498,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":637661,"brand_left":"\"Seiko\"@en","title_left":" \"Prospex Diver´s Revival Automatic Watch\"@en \"Seiko Prospex Watch SRP773K1 nur € 439.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12022250,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":398875,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Seiko SRP777K1 Prospex Mar Diver's\"@en \"Prospex Sea Seiko Automatic Diver's SRP777K1\"@en","description_right":"\"Seiko Prospex Sea watchSRP777K1 Automatic Diver's 200 m cal. 4R36\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Movement Automatic Dial Color Black Bracelet Rubber Size Male EAN 4954628198617"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":168,"row":{"pair_id":"17557321#17557376","label":0,"id_left":17557321,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":4695073,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Chopard Hour And Minutes Watch 388532-3002\" 388531-6004 | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p> A finely crafted timepiece makes a bold statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical accessory, a fine timepiece can also showcase your style. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are proud to offer diverse selection of some of the worldâ€™s finest luxury watch brands, including Chopard. We are also honored to be an authorized Chopard retailer in Los Angeles. Chopard's unique timepieces are designed to endure. This Ladies watch with model number 388532-3002 is part of the ever popular Hour and Minutes collection. The water resistance of this watch is 150 ft (50 meter).</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557376,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":4287506,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Chopard Hour And Minutes Watch 388531-3001\" 384221-0004 | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A finely crafted timepiece makes a bold statement of style. While many people think watches are simply a practical accessory, a fine timepiece can also showcase your style. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are delighted to offer vast selection of some of the worldâ€™s finest luxury watch brands, including Chopard. We are also proud to be an authorized Chopard retailer in Los Angeles. Chopard's unique timepieces are designed to last. This Ladies watch with model number 388531-3001 is part of the ever popular Hour and Minutes collection. The water resistance of this watch is 150 ft (50 meter).</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":169,"row":{"pair_id":"2266461#582810","label":0,"id_left":2266461,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":12500095,"brand_left":"\"Omega\"","title_left":" \"Omega Seamaster 300m 2531.80.00\" 2531.80.00 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            For a long time, the watch most closely associated with the legendary James Bond franchise was the Rolex Submariner. That all changed in 1995 with the release of GoldenEye. In this super-successful Bond outing, in which Pierce Brosnan gives an iconic performance as the renowned British spy, the watch seen on Bond's wrist is very clearly an Omega Seamaster. From that day forward, Bond has exclusively worn Omega timepieces, a partnership that has catapulted the brand's already prestigious reputation. A series of dazzling limited editions have appeared through the years—but it all started with this superb model.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Omega has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Omega certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":582810,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":10749316,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Carl F Bucherer Flyback Watch 00.10919.08.13.01\" \"Shop Carl 00.10919.03.33.01 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Naperville’s premier jeweler we offer a wide selection of precise watches.We are proud to be a Carl F Bucherer retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Carl F Bucherer watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Carl F Bucherer watches are crafted for precision and they are loved for their attention to detail. This 00.10919.08.13.01 Alligator Gents Carl F Bucherer watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":170,"row":{"pair_id":"14649025#615206","label":0,"id_left":14649025,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":189515,"brand_left":"\"TAG Heuer\"@de","title_left":" \" TAG HEUER CARRERA Calibre 5 Day-Date Automatikuhr 100 M - ∅41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 \"@de \"TAG Heuer Carrera Automatic Watch 41 | watch price\"@de","description_left":"\" Discover the TAG Heuer Carrera Calibre 5 Day-Date Automatic Watch 41 mm WAR201E.FC6292 Die Carrera Calibre 5-Reihe mit einem Modell mit Wochentags- und Datumsfenster – für Menschen, die Stil zu schätzen wissen..\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":615206,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":378814,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TAG Heuer Carrera Calibre 7 Twin Time 100 M - ∅41 mm Esfera gris Acero\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":171,"row":{"pair_id":"11329139#4606029","label":0,"id_left":11329139,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":227260,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Citizen Eco-Drive Satellite Wave F900 Promaster Navihawk GPS Sapphire Watch CC9030-51E \"@en | Dutyfreeislandshop.com\"@en","description_left":"\"\n        Satellite Timekeeping System (Reception Area: Worldwide)  \n\nComes with Special Promaster Case/Box - Please choose Box packaging\n    \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Brand Citizen Gender Men Glass Type Sapphire Virtually Scratch Proof Case Material Stainless Steel Strap Material Stainless Steel Movement Solar Powered Manufactured In Japan Made Movement Features Satellite Timekeeping System - Accurate Automatic global timekeeping via GPS Satellite Time Signal Reception Function Perpetual calendar (until February 28th 2100) A fully automatic calendar which automatically adjusts at the end of each month, including the months of a leap year. Daylight Savings Time Function Power Reserve Indicator Dual Time Calendar (Day & Date Display) Power Save Function 5 Years Eco-Drive Power Reserve Insufficient Charge Warning Overcharging Prevention Function Alarm Function Luminous Hands and Markers Rotating Slide Rule Bezel Display Analog Dial Color Black Case Width 47mm Case Depth 16mm Water Resistance 200m","id_right":4606029,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":13214181,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Silver Watch\"@en \"Michael Kors Silver Watch | SHOPBOP SAVE UP TO 30% Use Code: MORE17\"@en","description_right":"\"\n            This water-resistant stainless steel watch features a link band. Pavé rhinestones at bezel and dial. Date wheel and chronograph at dial. Hinged snap closure. Imported, China.MeasurementsDial: 1.5in / 4cmBand: 0.75in / 2cm\n                    Style #MKWAT20045\n                \n\n                \n    \n            \n                Request Manufacturer's Warranty\n        \n    \n\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":172,"row":{"pair_id":"11618246#9021173","label":1,"id_left":11618246,"category_left":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":2953072,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Samsung - Gear S2 Classic Smartwatch 40mm Stainless Steel Black Leather\"@en-US","description_left":"\"Never miss a call or text with this Samsung Gear S2 Classic smartwatch, which features Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and NFC technologies for simple connection to the Web or your compatible Android,  iOS device.¹ Receive notifications and check your schedule, or stay active using S Health or Nike+ Running. The leather band offers a stylish look.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9021173,"category_right":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":2953072,"brand_right":"\"Samsung\"","title_right":" \"Samsung Gear S2 Smartwatch - Classic\" \"Smart Watches Page 4 | All Fitness Gadgets\"","description_right":"\"With elegant curves and premium finishes, the Samsung Gear S2 classic will turn heads. The circular interface and rotating bezel give you effortless navigation, so you can quickly access the things that are most important to you. This intuitive interface lets you easily access important notifications, texts, and updates from your phone with just a glance at your wrist. Plus, with easily customizable watch faces and a premium 20mm leather watchband, you can create a watch style that is uniquely yours. The built-in S-Health app tracks your steps, your heart rate, and even gives you a nudge when itâ€™s time to get moving. And with built-in wireless charging, itâ€™s easy to keep the Gear S2 classic powered up. Whether youâ€™re at home, work or anywhere in between, you can power up by simply setting your Gear S2 on the included wireless charging dock. With powerful capabilities and sleek looks, the Gear S2 classic will help you get the most out of your day.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":173,"row":{"pair_id":"12102121#6596417","label":0,"id_left":12102121,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1804997,"brand_left":"\"TAG Heuer\"@zh-hant","title_left":" \"暢銷款 TAG HEUER CARRERA（卡萊拉系列） Calibre 5星期-日曆 自動上鏈腕錶 100米 - ∅41毫米 WAR201A.BA0723 \"@zh-hant \"TAG Heuer（泰格豪雅） Carrera Automatic Watch 41毫米 | watch price\"@zh-hant","description_left":"\" Discover the TAG Heuer（泰格豪雅） Carrera Calibre 5星期-日曆 Automatic Watch 41毫米 WAR201A.BA0723 TAG Heuer Carrera（卡萊拉）Calibre 5星期-日曆腕錶：  細緻奪目。.\"@zh-hant ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6596417,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11565157,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Bvlgari Solotempo Watch BGOP38WGLD\" BGOP41BGLD | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A fine timepiece makes a brilliant statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical device, a fine timepiece can also showcase your style. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are delighted to offer vast selection of some of the worldâ€™s most beloved luxury watch brands, including Bvlgari. We are also honored to be an authorized Bvlgari retailer in Los Angeles. Bvlgari's unique timepieces are built to endure. This Gents watch with model number BGOP38WGLD is part of the unique Solotempo collection. It features a precise Automatic (self winding) movement, Alligator band, and a 18k pink gold bezel.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":174,"row":{"pair_id":"2046867#3191988","label":0,"id_left":2046867,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":16202636,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Tank Francaise W50002N2\" W50002N2 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            The Cartier Tank, inspired by an actual tank, has been a design milestone since its inception in the early 20th century. Unlike the modified pocket watches being made by other manufacturers, the Tank used a new case design that actually incorporated the lugs into its shape, rather than adding them as an afterthought. Other iconic design elements include the blued sword hands, Roman numerals, elegant square dial and octagonal crown complete with sapphire cabochon. The Française collection adds a somewhat sportier, more modern feel to an already superb timepiece, making it bolder and more versatile, in large part thanks to its chain-link bracelet—which looks even better in this ravishing all-gold model.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":3191988,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":14033712,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Tank Francaise W51008Q3\" W51008Q3 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\", \"\n                            The Cartier Tank has been a design milestone since its inception in the early 20th century. Unlike the modified pocket watches being made by other manufacturers, the Tank used a new case design—inspired by the shape of a tank—that actually incorporated the lugs into its shape, rather than adding them as an afterthought. Other iconic design elements include the blued sword hands, Roman numerals, elegant square dial and octagonal crown complete with sapphire cabochon. The Française collection adds a somewhat sportier, more modern feel to an already superb timepiece, making it bolder and more versatile, in large part thanks to its chain-link bracelet.\n                            \n                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":175,"row":{"pair_id":"4199240#1052221","label":1,"id_left":4199240,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":268027,"brand_left":"\"Seiko\"@de","title_left":" \"Astron GPS Solar Dual Time\"@de 00 €\"@de \"Seiko Astron Time SSE047J1 nur 1.955","description_left":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 1328 SSE047J1\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tDiese Herrenuhr aus dem Hause Seiko vereinigt modernste Technik und edle Materialien.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie legendäre Astron-Kollektion mit GPS Solar WeltzeituhrDamals verfügte jeder Ort über eine eigene Uhrzeit. Stand die Sonne am höchsten Punkt, so war es 12 Uhr. \n\nDies führte in späterer Zeit zu Verwirrung bezüglich Fahrplänen von Bus oder Bahn.\nEin weltweites Zeitzonensystem wurde erstmals im Jahre 1879 vorgeschlagen - dies führte nach einigen Konferenzen dazu, dass die Erde in 24 Stundenzonen eingeteilt wurde. \nHier liegen die Differenzen zwischen jeder Zeitzone eine Stunde und somit 23 Stunden maximal zu der jeweils rückwärts gesehenen Zeitzone.\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tSeiko Astron ist die erste weltweit funktionierende Funkarmbanduhr mit GPS-ZeitzonenerkennungEs gibt insgesamt 24 Zeitzonen, die je 15 Längengrade umfassen und beim Nullmeridian beginnen. Beim Übergang von einer zur folgenden Zeitzone verschiebt sich die Zeit um eine Stunde. Je nach Himmelsrichtung verschiebt sich die Zeit entweder eine Stunde nach hinten ( Westen) oder nach vorne (Osten).\nDie wichtigsten internationalen Zeitsignale sind: DCF77 (Deutschland) in Mainflingen in Hessen, MSF (Großbritannien) in Anthorn, JJY (Japan), WWV (USA) in Fort Collins, WWVH (USA) auf Hawaii, BPC (China) in Shangqiu\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon. Der Name Astron ist bei der japanischen Uhrenmanufaktur kein Unbekannter: 1969 präsentierte Seiko mit der Astron die weltweit erste Quarzarmbanduhr und veränderte die Uhrenindustrie damit nachhaltig. Die neue Astron sorgt nun auf Reisen für eine noch komfortablere Zeitzonenumstellung mit Solarenergie.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tSeiko hat die Erde in eine Million Quadrate unterteilt und jedem dieser Quadrate die richtige Zeitzone zugewiesen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tIm Freien kann die Seiko Astron das exakte Zeitsignal der AtomuhrBei der Atomuhr handelt es sich um einen Zeitmesser, dem die hochfrequente Schwingungsdauer bestimmter Atome zugrunde liegt (z.B. Caesium oder Rubidium). Diese werden dann durch ein elektromagnetisches Feld oder optisches Pumpen zu Schwingungen angeregt und synchronisieren so einen Quarzgenerator.  Der Amerikaner Isidor Isaac Rabi (1898-1988) entwickelte die erste Atomuhr an der Columbia University und erhielt dafür im Jahr 1944 den Nobelpreis.\nIm Jahr 1973 begann die  Physikalisch-Technische Bundesanstalt (PTB) in Braunschweig damit, Caesiumuhren-Zeitsignale (einschließlich Kalenderangaben und Informationen über die Sommerzeit) über den Langwellensender DCF77 in Mainflingen bei Frankfurt am Main abzustrahlen. Der DCF77-Sender der PTB verbreitet das Zeitsignal auf einer Langwellenfrequenz von 77,5 kHz mit einem Radius von etwa 1.500 km. Im Vereinten Königreich, in Japan und in den USA existieren ähnlich funktionierende Zeitsignalsender. \n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon eines GPS-Satelliten empfangen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDarüber hinaus nutzt die Astron die Vorteile des GPS-Systems zur Standortbestimmung und ZeitzonenerkennungEs gibt insgesamt 24 Zeitzonen, die je 15 Längengrade umfassen und beim Nullmeridian beginnen. Beim Übergang von einer zur folgenden Zeitzone verschiebt sich die Zeit um eine Stunde. Je nach Himmelsrichtung verschiebt sich die Zeit entweder eine Stunde nach hinten ( Westen) oder nach vorne (Osten).\nDie wichtigsten internationalen Zeitsignale sind: DCF77 (Deutschland) in Mainflingen in Hessen, MSF (Großbritannien) in Anthorn, JJY (Japan), WWV (USA) in Fort Collins, WWVH (USA) auf Hawaii, BPC (China) in Shangqiu\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Astro Uhr nutzt die Zeitsignale des GPS-Satellitennetzes, die durch mindestens 24 aktive Satelliten die gesamte Erdoberfläche abdecken.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür Reisende ist die ZeitzonenumstellungEs gibt insgesamt 24 Zeitzonen, die je 15 Längengrade umfassen und beim Nullmeridian beginnen. Beim Übergang von einer zur folgenden Zeitzone verschiebt sich die Zeit um eine Stunde. Je nach Himmelsrichtung verschiebt sich die Zeit entweder eine Stunde nach hinten ( Westen) oder nach vorne (Osten).\nDie wichtigsten internationalen Zeitsignale sind: DCF77 (Deutschland) in Mainflingen in Hessen, MSF (Großbritannien) in Anthorn, JJY (Japan), WWV (USA) in Fort Collins, WWVH (USA) auf Hawaii, BPC (China) in Shangqiu\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon jetzt so komfortabel wie nie zuvor: Sie müssen sich nur im Freien aufhalten und einen Drücker für sechs Sekunden betätigen, automatisch nimmt Ihre Astron Verbindung zu mindestens vier Satelliten auf, ermittelt Ihren Standort und die dazugehörige Zeitzone und stellt die Uhr in 30 Sekunden auf die aktuelle Ortszeit ein.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEine Anzeige für eine Zweite Zeitzone - ein Ewiger KalenderEinen ewigen Kalender in die präzise Technik eines Uhrwerks zu integrieren ist keine leichte Aufgabe. Es werden Tag, Wochentag, Wochenzähler, Monat, Jahreszeit, Schaltjahresanzeige und Mondphase über die Jahre hinweg präzise angezeigt, ungeachtet der geraden und ungeraden Monate oder der Schaltjahre. Unsere Zeitrechnung geht auf den gregorianischen Kalender zurück, nach dem das Jahr 365 Tage, 5 Stunden, 48 Minuten und 46 Sekunden dauert. Da uns nach dieser Rechnung jedes Jahr circa sechs Stunden verloren gehen, wird alle vier Jahre ein Schaltjahr eingeschoben, um den Verlust wieder auszugleichen. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon und die automatische Anpassung von Sommerzeit mit nur einem Knopfdruck komplettieren die Ausstattung der Uhr.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Solar-Zifferblatt ist weiß mit Leuchtzeigern und -indizes (LumiBrite), damit auch im Dunkeln die genaue Uhrzeit zu erkennen ist.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf der 4-Uhr Position befindet sich zudem eine Datumsanzeige und ewiger Kalender bis Februar 2100.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tBei dem Uhrwerk handelt es sich um ein ökologisches Solarwerk 8X53 Werk (Dual Time)\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem schwarzen Zifferblatt befindet sich ein \"Seiko Astro GPS Solar\" Schriftzug.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse ist aus hochwertigem TitaniumTitan (Ti) ist ein chemisches Element und wird zu den Übergangsmetallen gezählt. Titan zeichnet sich durch besondere Festigkeit ,Korrosions- und temperaturbeständigkeit bei geringem Gewicht aus und ist daher für die Verarbeitung in Uhrengehäusen und -bändern besonders geeignet.\nDa Titan in reiner Form praktisch nicht vorkommt, wird es aus Titanverbindungen, z.B. dem Titaneisenerz (Ilmenit) oder dem Titandioxid (Rutil) hergestellt. Da dieser Prozess sehr aufwändig ist, kostet Titan etwa das Zehnfache im Vergleich zu Stahl. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon hergestellt und hat eine fein gebürstete Oberfläche.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin doppelt-entspiegeltes SaphirglasSaphirglas (Al2O3) ist von den üblichen Uhrengläsern das härteste. Lediglich der Diamant und einige Karbide weisen eine größere Härte auf und können Kratzer auf einem Saphirglas verursachen. Da Saphirglas relativ stark spiegelt, wird es häufig mit einer Beschichtung versehen (sog. 'Antireflex-Saphir'), die dann leider nicht dieselbe Widerstandsfähigkeit aufweist. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon mit Super-Clear-Beschichtung sorgt für einen klaren Blick auf das Zifferblatt.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDer verschraubter Gehäuseboden und die verschraubte Krone gewähren eine WasserdichtigkeitDie Angaben über die  Wasserdichtigkeit von Uhren führen immer wieder zu Missverständnissen, da die  angegebenen Meterangaben meist wenig Aussagekraft haben. Im Folgenden nun ein  paar Richtlinien, die den richtigen Umgang mit ihrer Uhr und Wasser erleichtern  sollen:\nEs kann auch vorkommen, dass die Angabe der Wasserdichtigkeit in Bar statt Metern vorliegt. Dies ist  dann folgendermaßen zu verstehen:\n3 bar = 30 m / 5 bar = 50 m  / 10 bar = 100 m / 20 bar = 200 m \t Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon von 10 bar.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Lünette ist aus hochwertigem Keramik hergestellt und mit schwarzem TitankarbidTitan (Ti) ist ein chemisches Element und wird zu den Übergangsmetallen gezählt. Titan zeichnet sich durch besondere Festigkeit ,Korrosions- und temperaturbeständigkeit bei geringem Gewicht aus und ist daher für die Verarbeitung in Uhrengehäusen und -bändern besonders geeignet.\nDa Titan in reiner Form praktisch nicht vorkommt, wird es aus Titanverbindungen, z.B. dem Titaneisenerz (Ilmenit) oder dem Titandioxid (Rutil) hergestellt. Da dieser Prozess sehr aufwändig ist, kostet Titan etwa das Zehnfache im Vergleich zu Stahl. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon beschichtet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDer Gehäusedurchmesser beträgt ca. 45 mm und hat eine Höhe von ca. 13.3 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin feines Gliederarmband aus hochwertigem TitanTitan (Ti) ist ein chemisches Element und wird zu den Übergangsmetallen gezählt. Titan zeichnet sich durch besondere Festigkeit ,Korrosions- und temperaturbeständigkeit bei geringem Gewicht aus und ist daher für die Verarbeitung in Uhrengehäusen und -bändern besonders geeignet.\nDa Titan in reiner Form praktisch nicht vorkommt, wird es aus Titanverbindungen, z.B. dem Titaneisenerz (Ilmenit) oder dem Titandioxid (Rutil) hergestellt. Da dieser Prozess sehr aufwändig ist, kostet Titan etwa das Zehnfache im Vergleich zu Stahl. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon gewährt einen besonders angenehmen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Band wird mit einer Sicherheitsfaltschließe verschlossen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin Tutorial zur Funktionsweise der Uhr finden sie hier: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d6QMcAKwf9A.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":1052221,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":268027,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Seiko Astron Men's GPS Titanium Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SSE047J1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This gents Seiko Astron Gps watch has a titanium case and is fitted with a chronograph quartz movement. It is fastened with a silver metal  bracelet and has a off white dial.  The watch also has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":176,"row":{"pair_id":"9911916#2000268","label":0,"id_left":9911916,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":531368,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Ladies' Winchester Rose 36mm Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (DW00100033) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This slim-line ladies Daniel Wellington Winchester Rose 36mm watch has a PVD rose plating case and is powered by an analogue quartz movement. It fastens a multicolour fabric strap and has a cream dial. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2000268,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":300416,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Casio Ladies' Junior Collection Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (LQ-139LB-2B2ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This ladies Casio Junior Collection watch is made from plastic/resin and is powered by a quartz movement. It is fitted with a multicolour leather  strap and has a off white dial. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":177,"row":{"pair_id":"4528473#3876255","label":0,"id_left":4528473,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":382181,"brand_left":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_left":" \"Chronoscope Max Bill\"@en 645.00\"@en \"Junghans Chronoscope Bill 027/4600.00 nur € 1","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":3876255,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":934341,"brand_right":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_right":" \"Automatic watch Max Bill\"@en \"Junghans Automatic Bill 027/7700.00 nur € 955.00\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" General Target Group: Mens Case housing diameter: 38 mm Shape: Round glass: Synthetic crystal Material: Stainless steel"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":178,"row":{"pair_id":"1268575#4561083","label":0,"id_left":1268575,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":538280,"brand_left":"\"Michael Kors\"","title_left":" \"Michael Kors MK3192 Darci watch\"","description_left":"\"            \t                    Trendy watches designed by fashion icon Michael Kors, until you look at the latest trends. With Michael Kors watch, you are sure that you set the tone rather than follow! Also with this trendy  Michael Kors MK3192 Darci ladies watch. The eye-catching rose gold color round stainless steel case is embellished with three rows of CZ stones around the dial. The diameter of the case is 39 mm. The rose gold stainless steel band has a elegant appereance. The watch is equipped with a quartz movement, mineral crystal and has a water resistance of 5 ATM, Waterproof up to 50 meters. Showering. Not suitable for snorkling. 2 year guarantee on the movement. Comes in luxury brandbox. If necessary a tool is provided to shorten the strap of your watch.            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":4561083,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":667869,"brand_right":"\"Michael Kors\"","title_right":" \"Michael Kors MK3493 Slim Runway watch\"","description_right":"\"            \t                    Trendy watches designed by fashion icon Michael Kors, until you look at the latest trends. With Michael Kors watch, you are sure that you set the tone rather than follow! Also with this trendy  Michael Kors Slim Runway MK3493 Ladies watch . The eye-catching twotone rose gold color of the round stainless steel case make this a striking model. The diameter of the case is 42 mm. The matching rose gold stainless steel band has a width of 20 mm. The watch is equipped with a quartz movement, mineral crystal and has a water resistance of 5 ATM, Waterproof up to 50 meters. Showering. Not suitable for snorkling. 2 year guarantee on the movement. Comes in luxury brandbox. If necessary a tool is provided to shorten the strap of your watch.            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":179,"row":{"pair_id":"1743996#12174968","label":0,"id_left":1743996,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":679144,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Tissot Men's Classic Dream Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (T0334102205301) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Mens Tissot Classic Dream watch in a stylish two-tone design in steel and gold plate. The black dial has a date function and elegant Roman numeral hour markers.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12174968,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":5317159,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Panerai 2013 Watch PAM00364\" \"Shop Panerai PAM00446 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This exquisite luxury watch, model number PAM00364 from Panerai provides luxury and top notch functionality for your everyday fashion. This Gents timepiece has features appreciated by today’s watch aficionados. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the watch of numerous functionality and indescribable style. A black dial is perfect for those with a refined taste in watches. Its automatic (self winding) movement features complications you’ll come to cherish. This timepiece includes small second hand, date complications. Its complications will make you wonder in awe of the work it took to make this quality timepiece. The numbers on this timepiece are in index style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The neat round case is 47 mm. The case is finely crafted of titanium, both eye catching and was crafted to last a long time. The watch’s rubber band is smooth and made out of the highest quality materials. This watch's bezel features eye-catching titanium that speaks for itself. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be found on your wrist. It goes around the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has everything from simple timepieces to ones you’ll want to keep in the family forever. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":180,"row":{"pair_id":"1331598#8968506","label":0,"id_left":1331598,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1704048,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Gucci YA1264007 G-Timeless Mens Swiss Watch\"","description_left":" \" Gucci YA1264007 G-Timeless Mens Swiss Watch “Le Marché Des Merveilles” 38mm polished stainless steel case – Grey leather dial with snake print Dial bee index at 12 o’clock and 11 pyramidal indexes Stainless snapped back Case engraving strap ardillon buckle Silver colored hour minute hands Sapphire crystal antireflective coating ETA Quartz movement Water resistant to 5 ATM (50 meters/160 feet) Swiss made 100% original - authentic Brand new Comes box booklet warranty card serial number price tag watches come a 3 year from Watches-Swiss.com is also known as 462912 I18A0 8606","price_left":"\"621.00\", \"USD\"","specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8968506,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1146389,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Unisex Gucci G-Timeless Watch YA1264018 \"Luxury Mens Watches\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":181,"row":{"pair_id":"5775498#16725758","label":1,"id_left":5775498,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":637661,"brand_left":"\"Seiko\"@en","title_left":" \"Prospex Diver´s Revival Automatic Watch\"@en \"Seiko Prospex Watch SRP773K1 nur € 439.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":16725758,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":637661,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Seiko SRP773K1 Prospex Mar Diver's\"@en \"Prospex Sea Seiko Automatic Diver's SRP773K1\"@en","description_right":"\"Seiko Prospex Sea watchSRP773K1 Automatic Diver's 200 m cal. 4R36\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Movement Automatic Dial Color Blue Bracelet Steel / Titanium Size Male EAN 4954628198594"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":182,"row":{"pair_id":"15230481#8261097","label":0,"id_left":15230481,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":3102710,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Michele Deco Mid Watch MWW06V000002\" \"Shop Michele MWW06V000003 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This hand-crafted luxury watch, model number MWW06V000002 from Michele gives style and top notch function for your everyday fashion. This Ladies timepiece only hints at the fine watchmaking within this timepiece. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of numerous functionality and exquisite style. A white dial provides superior readability. Its quartz (battery) movement has unrivaled high-precision. This watch includes small second hand complications. Its complications will amaze you because of this piece’s technical precision. The digits on this timepiece are in diamond style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The case is finely crafted of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s stainless steel band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks volumes. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. It goes around the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 150 ft (50 meter) water resistance. The true highlight of this piece is the diamonds that are located in the dial of this watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has everything from simple timepieces to ones you’ll want to keep in the family forever. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8261097,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":6012735,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"IWC Ingenieur Watch IW380802\" \"Shop IWC IW381701 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This well crafted watch, model number IW380802 from IWC offers luxury and high tech functionality for watch enthusiasts and average wearers alike. This Gents timepiece only hints at the fine watchmaking within this timepiece. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the timepiece of insurmountable functionality and unparalleled style. A blue dial provides superior readability. Its automatic (self winding) movement has world-class mechanics that can stand the test of time. This watch includes central 60 second hand, chronograph, date complications. Its complications will amaze you because of this piece’s technical precision. The numbers on this timepiece are in index style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The neat round case is 42 mm. The case is finely crafted of stainless steel, both attention grabbing and is crafted to last. The watch’s stainless steel band fits snugly and fashionably over your wrist. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks volumes. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 492 ft (150 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has a stunning selection of watches from the best watchmakers in the world. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":183,"row":{"pair_id":"8228304#11498213","label":0,"id_left":8228304,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1066720,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Engineer Hydrocarbon Airborne\"@en \"Ball Watch | Engineer Airborne - Model DM2076C-S1CAJ-BK\"@en","description_left":"\"Ball Watch | Engineer Hydrocarbon Airborne - Model DM2076C-S1CAJ-BK\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11498213,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":486308,"brand_right":"\"Seiko\"","title_right":" \"Seiko SGG731P1 watch\"","description_right":"\"            \t                    This titanium Seiko  watch is fitted with quartz movement and a beautiful titanium strap. The watch case color of this Men watch is grey The crystal fitted in this watch is an extra strong sapphire crystal The water resitance of this model is 10 Atm. / 100 meters (or waterproof): These watches are suitable for most kinds of water sports such as swimming, sailing and snorkeling in shallow water. They are inappropriate for tower jumping or scuba diving If you choose for a Seiko watch, you choose for quality and a watch which will last you for years!\nIf necessary a tool is provided to shorten the strap of your watch.\n            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":184,"row":{"pair_id":"4777632#10810033","label":1,"id_left":4777632,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":12886821,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Tank Americaine W2603556\" W2603556 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10810033,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":12886821,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier\", \"CartierCartier Tank Series Unisex Watch W2603556\"","description_right":"\"See a beautiful diamond watch or a jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you our FREE layaway plan. Just give us a toll-free call on 1-877-577-TIME or send us an email to sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad to take your order\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Item spec Gender Unisex Case Material 18kt Yellow Gold Dial Color Silver Bracelet Black Leather Clasp Tang Buckle Movement Automatic Bezel Fixed Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Case Back Solid Water Resistant 30m/100ft General Item # W2603556 MSRP $10,925.00 Brand Cartier"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":185,"row":{"pair_id":"13124970#11884590","label":0,"id_left":13124970,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":519344,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Rolex 116710LN GMT-Master II Steel Watch\"@en Watches From SwissLuxury\"@en","description_left":"\"Rolex Oyster Perpetual Date GMT-Master II Watch40mm stainless steel case, bidirectional rotatable bezel with 24-hour engraved black Cerachrom insert, green 24 hour second time zone hand, independent 12 hour hand, black dial, and stainless steel Oyster Fliplock bracelet with Easylink 5 mm comfort extension link. Water resistant to 100 meters.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11884590,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":12241661,"brand_right":"\"Rolex\"","title_right":" \"Rolex GMT Master II 116713 LN\" LN Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Rolex has undergone a thorough inspection of water resistance, accuracy, functionality and condition to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been referenced against technical documents and manufacturer records where available to ensure authenticity and a clean history.\", \"\n                            The GMT Master was first commissioned in the 1950s by pioneering airline Pan Am, and was designed for aviation. An increase in flight distances created demand for a watch that was able to tell the time in two different parts of the world simultaneously, so Rolex built it with an additional hand that could be set to a second time zone. By the 1980s, the watch had developed into the GMT Master II and was already a favourite among collectors. This model represents a significant upgrade for the watch, boasting an aerospace-grade steel case and cerachrom inserts in the bezel. A variant on the regular 116710, this reference features gold elements in the bezel, crown, hands, indices and of course the bracelet.\n                            \n                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":186,"row":{"pair_id":"8014072#14550671","label":0,"id_left":8014072,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":388422,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Mens Casio G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass Alarm Chronograph Radio Controlled Watch GWG-1000-1A3ER\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Brand Casio Case Width 51 Case Depth 15 Model Name G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass MPN GWG-1000-1A3ER EAN 4971850028345 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Stainless Steel and Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Hour Markers Batons Strap colour Khaki Warranty 2 years Brand Casio Case Width 51 Case Depth 15 Model Name G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass MPN GWG-1000-1A3ER EAN 4971850028345 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Stainless Steel and Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Hour Markers Batons Strap colour Khaki Warranty 2 years","id_right":14550671,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":191955,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Mens Casio G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass Black x Gold Alarm Chronograph Radio Controlled Watch GWG-1000GB-1AER\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Brand Casio Case Width 45 Case Depth 17 Model Name G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass Black x Gold MPN GWG-1000GB-1AER EAN 4971850031468 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Plastic/Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Glass Mineral Strap colour Black Warranty 2 years Brand Casio Case Width 45 Case Depth 17 Model Name G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass Black x Gold MPN GWG-1000GB-1AER EAN 4971850031468 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Plastic/Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Glass Mineral Strap colour Black Warranty 2 years"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":187,"row":{"pair_id":"1477660#14235954","label":1,"id_left":1477660,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1186111,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Seiko Astron SSE025J1 GPS Solar Cronógrafo\"@es precios y catálogo oficiales de relojes Seiko\"@es Reloj Seiko Cronógrafo Edición Limitada \"Reloj","description_left":"\"Reloj Seiko Astron SSE025J1 GPS Solar Cronógrafo, distribuidor Seiko Barcelona, precios y catálogo oficial de relojes Seiko en Laguarda joiers Barcelona\"@es ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Movimiento Solar Color Esfera Marrón Brazalete Piel/Cuero Tamaño Hombre EAN 4954628188762","id_right":14235954,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1186111,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Seiko Astron Men's GPS Titanium Chronograph Solar Powered Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SSE025J1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This men's Seiko Astron Gps watch has a titanium titanium case and is fitted with a chronograph solar movement. It is fastened with a brown leather  strap and has a brown dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":188,"row":{"pair_id":"2035665#7272784","label":1,"id_left":2035665,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":9006964,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Suunto Men's Ambit 3 HR Bluetooth GPS Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SS020678000) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Key features: \n\nMULTISPORT\n\nRoute navigation\nUp to 25 h battery life with GPS\nCompass\nGPS altitude\nHeart rate in swimming**\nActivity based recovery time\nSpeed, pace and distance\nBike power support (Bluetooth Smart)\nMultiple sports in one log\nTraining programs\nGrowing feature set through Suunto Apps\n\n**with Suunto Smart Sensor\nNote! The Ambit3 watches are not compatible with ANT+� (e.g. Suunto ANT PODs, Suunto Dual or Suunto ANT belt)\n\nCONNECTIVITY\n\nUpload and share your moves instantly*\nCustomize your watch on the go*\nTime and GPS satellite data up to date on the go*\nUse your phone as second watch display * (Add an extended battery pack for your iPhone to support even longer adventures.)\nSee calls, messages and push notifications on the watch*\n\nENRICH, RELIVE AND SHARE\n\nTake photos during your Move showing your current speed, distance, and more*\nCreate a Suunto Movie of your Move with 3D map, key metrics and images*\nShare your experience instantly to your social media networks*\n\n*with the Suunto Movescount App and smartphone\n\nCOMPATIBLE DEVICES WITH THE SUUNTO MOVESCOUNT APP ARE: \n\niPad 3rd generation and later\niPad Mini/iPad Air\niPhone 4s/iPhone 5/iPhone 5c/iPhone 5s\niPod touch 5th generation\niPhone and iPad are trademarks of Apple Inc.\n\nAmbit3 Peak and Ambit3 Sport support notifications from iPhone/iPad in the following languages: English, Dutch, Finnish, French, German, Italian, Portuguese, Spanish and Swedish.\n\nWHAT'S IN THE BOX?\t\nSuunto Ambit3 Sport Black, Suunto Smart Sensor and heart rate belt, USB cable, Quick Guide, Warranty Leaflet\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7272784,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":9006964,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Suunto Ambit 3 Sports with HR - Black\"@en \" Suunto Heart Rate Accessories Black \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Keep track of your heart rate and running performance while you work out with this multisport watch for a personalised experience. Use with the free Suunto Movescount App to plan your workouts and get voice guidance during your workout. You can also adjust the watch on the go and share your experience with others. Features Include:15h battery life with 5-sec GPS accuracy.Speed pace distance and GPS altitude.Route navigation and track back.Compass.Heart rate in swimming.Bike power support (Bluetooth Smart).Multiple sports in one log.Interval workout planner.Interval workouts with voice guidance.Activity based recovery time.Quick recovery and sleep recovery tests (Firstbeat).Movescount training programs on watch.Extended feature set through Suunto Apps.Languages: EN CS DA DE ES FI FR IT JA KO NL NO PL PT RU SV ZH.\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":189,"row":{"pair_id":"1192600#142318","label":0,"id_left":1192600,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15224940,"brand_left":"\"Chopard\"","title_left":" \"Chopard LUC 161934-5001\" 161934-5001 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            L.U.C. stands for Louis-Ulysse Chopard, the brand's 19th-century founder, who is remembered for his extraordinary horological talents, creating masterpieces that wowed connoisseurs around the world. So it is no surprise that when the modern company, today run by family Scheufele, was looking to return to making prestigious, in-house movements in the 1990s, it named the resulting collection after its forefather and guiding light, L.U.C. This striking limited edition features a moonphase—a coveted complication under any circumstances, but here enhanced with both mechanical and artistic skill to create a magnificent and incredibly accurate orbital display for both hemispheres.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Chopard has undergone a thorough inspection of water resistance, accuracy, functionality and condition to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been referenced against technical documents and manufacturer records where available to ensure authenticity and a clean history.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Age 1 year (2015) Box Yes Papers Yes Watchfinder warranty 12 months* This watch is covered by our comprehensive 12 month warranty, giving you a full year of peace of mind. Delivery Free Returns policy 14 days* If you receive your watch in the post and don't like it, you have fourteen days from receipt to return it for a full refund. Product code 71682 Gender mens Movement Automatic Case size 40 MM Case material Rose Gold Bracelet material Alligator - Black Dial type Silver Roman Numeral Water resistance 30 metres","id_right":142318,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":4695073,"brand_right":"\"Chopard\"","title_right":" \"Chopard Imperiale 388532-3002\" 388532-3002 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Chopard has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been referenced against technical documents and manufacturer records where available to ensure authenticity and a clean history.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Age 4 years (2013) Box Yes Papers Yes Watchfinder warranty 12 months* This watch is covered by our comprehensive 12 month warranty, giving you a full year of peace of mind. Delivery Free Returns policy 14 days* If you receive your watch in the post and don't like it, you have fourteen days from receipt to return it for a full refund. Product code 52602 Gender ladies Movement Quartz Case size 36 MM Case material Steel Bracelet material Steel Dial type Silver Roman Numeral Water resistance N/A"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":190,"row":{"pair_id":"7728833#7318285","label":0,"id_left":7728833,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":3469,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Men's Glasgow Silver 36mm Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DW00100047) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This slim-line gents Daniel Wellington Glasgow Silver 36mm watch is made from stainless steel and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fastened with a multicolour fabric strap and has a white dial. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7318285,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":27385,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Seiko Men's Sportura GPS Solar Powered Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SSF003J1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This men's Seiko Sportura Gps watch is made from stainless steel and is powered by an analogue solar movement. It is fitted with a silver metal  bracelet and has a black dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":191,"row":{"pair_id":"11410756#11486201","label":0,"id_left":11410756,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":353191,"brand_left":"\"Suunto\"@en","title_left":" \"SUUNTO TRAVERSE ALPHA STEALTH\"@en apparel and sports equipment\"@en STEALTH - TREKKING WATCH Suunto colour Black SS022469000 Athletic footwear","description_left":"\"<p>Suunto sports watch Alpha Traverse Stealth GPS/Glonass functionality. Outdoor activities will always be under control with this new versatile and reliable measurement and navigation tool. The Alpha version is designed for outdoor works related to hunting and fishing.</p>\n<p>Go Explore<br>Suunto Traverse Alpha conjugates qualities of a sturdy structure and a full range of features for outdoors. Is your guide in the wilderness, which helps keep the GPS/GLONASS navigation guidance. Specific features for hunting and fishing will provide useful tools for your business, including the timing of lunar phases, stroke detection, the alert dawn, the weather trend indicator, and the red backlight for night use. Plan routes and keep a diary of your fishing and hunting outings with SuunTo Movescount.com.<p>\n<p>The moon phase calendar based on the position with the time of rise and decline of the Moon helps you determine the best times for fishing, while the barometric pressure graph allows you to precisely follow the weather changes.</p>\n<p>Automatic identification of hit tracks the number and position of the strokes. While exploring, you can use the specific POI to mark the routes and important positions. Sunrise and sunset Alerts help you plan your day, while customizable red backlight does not interfere with your night vision.</p>\n<p>Create routes on Suunto Movescount with topographic maps and elevation data. View profile of altitude of your itinerary directly from the watch. The atmospheric pressure measurement integrated sensor keeps track of your climb with precision. Save points of interest along the route and,If necessary, retrace your steps with the automatic route tracking feature (breadcrumb). Using the digital compass to orient yourself quickly on unknown territory.<p>\n<p>With knurled stainless steel bezel, black nylon strap waterproof and scratch-resistant Sapphire Crystal, Suunto Traverse Alpha is the perfect watch for hunters, fishermen and hikers who want an extremely durable. Vibrating alerts and the red backlight, compatible with night vision goggles, they make you go unnoticed.</p>\n<p>Outdoor watches, Suunto sleepers and Traverse Alpha have been tested in accordance with military standards (MIL STD 819G). Have passed the 19 tests, including tests for vibration, shock, drop, freezing and thawing, rain, humidity, immersion, dust and sand.</p>\n<p>Dominates the area with GPS/GLONASS navigation: uses features specific to the cacCIA, fishing and hiking. Suunto Traverse is manufactured in Finland and tested according to military standards.<p>\n<p>Main features:<br>-How hiking, fishing and hunting<br>-Hours and warnings of sunrise and sunset<br>-POI types specific to fishing and hunting<br>-Moon phases and times of rise and decline of the Moon<br>-Automatic detection of stroke<br>-Red Backlight, night vision compatible<br>-GPS and GLONASS for sailing routes and POIs<br>-Automatic route tracking feature (breadcrumb) in real time<br>-Detection of speed, distance and altitude<br>-Route planning in Suunto Movescount.com with topographic maps<br>-Preview of route and altitude profile of the route on the clock<br>-Water resistance to 100 m/330 feet<br>-Altitude (FusedAlti ™)<br>Weather trends and storm alarm<br>-Knockthe<br>-Backlight flashlight mode<br>-Vibration<br>-GPS update now<br>-Monitoring of steps and calories during daily activities, weekly, monthly, and yearly<br>-Notifications on your phone<br>-Compatible with Suunto Movescount (iOS and Android)<p>\n<p>Package contents:<br>-Suunto Traverse Alpha Stealth<br>-USB cable<br>-Quick Start Guide<br>-Warranty information</p>\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" SKU SS022469000 Size S.T. Brand Suunto Product category Trekking Watch Color Black EAN 6417084201928","id_right":11486201,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":9940356,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Apple - Apple Watch Series 2 38mm Space Gray Aluminum Case Black Sport Band Aluminum\"@en-US","description_right":"\"Apple Watch Series 2 is a superior sports watch that measures your workouts with detailed customizable metrics. An advanced activity tracker that shows you how often you move, exercise, and stand, and lets you share your progress. A powerful health tool that helps you be more conscious of your overall well-being, starting with your heart rate. And an all-day assistant that provides instant access to the people, apps, and information you care about most. There are cases made from aluminum and stainless steel and a full range of interchangeable bands in a variety of styles, colors, and materials. All models run watchOS 3. Requires an iPhone 5 or later.\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":192,"row":{"pair_id":"4105864#13407150","label":1,"id_left":4105864,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":549167,"brand_left":"\"Seiko\"@de","title_left":" \"Seiko 5 Herren-Automatikuhr\"@de 00 €\"@de Seiko Herren-Automatikuhr SRP601K1 nur 229","description_left":"\"\n\t\t\t\t\tArtikel-Nr.: 1327 SRP601K1\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tModisch-sportliche AutomatikuhrDie Automatikuhr ist eine mechanische Armbanduhr, bei der die Feder bei Armbewegungen des Trägers durch einen Rotor in kleinen Schritten aufgezogen wird.\nDer Rotor, der zumeist kugelgelagert ist, bleibt bei Bewegungen des Uhrgehäuses aufgrund seiner Massenträgheit und der Schwerkraft im Raum stehen, wobei ein Drehmoment auf den Aufziehmechanismus ausgeübt wird. Im Normalfall wird die Feder in beide Drehrichtungen aufgezogen. Liegt die Drehbewegung des Gehäuses in der Achse des Rotors, so beruht das Prinzip allein auf dem Trägheitsmoment des Rotors. Dieses Phänomen funktioniert also auch in der Schwerelosigkeit. Bei Drehbewegungen, die senkrecht zur Achse des Rotors stattfinden, kommt die Exzentrizität desselben zum Tragen: Der Rotor ist zumeist nur halbkreisförmig ausgebildet, so dass sein Schwerpunkt nicht mit seiner Achse zusammenfällt. Wird die Uhr nur leicht aus der Horizontalen gedreht, genügt dies gegebenenfalls für eine 180-Grad-Drehung des Rotors. Eine Rutschkupplung verhindert ein Überdrehen der Zugfeder, wenn die Uhr bereits voll aufgezogen ist. Automatikuhren zeichnen sich neben ihrer einfachen Handhabung auch durch einen erheblich gleichmäßigeren Lauf aus, der durch die stets gleichmäßig gespannte Feder ausgelöst wird.  Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon der Marke Seiko\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse ist aus hochwertigem, massivem Edelstahl hergestellt und hat eine fein gebürstete Oberfläche.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem schwarzen Zifferblatt befindet sich ein Seiko 5 Logo.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Zeiger und IndizesIndizes ist das deutsche Wort für das lateinische Index. Spricht man von Indizes, dann sind die Zahlen die die Zeit anzeigen (bei vielen Uhren z.B. arabische Zahlen: 3, 6, 9, 12, aber auch z.B. römische Zahlen: III, VI, IX, XII) oder stattdessen die Platzhalter dafür gemeint. Platzhalter können je nach Gestaltung der Uhr die Unterschiedlichsten Formen haben. Uhrenindexe werden oft nicht nur aufgemalt sondern auch aufgesetzt – bei exklusiven Uhren auch veredelt (mit z.B. Gold, Rosegold, Silber, Chrom). Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon haben eine rote Beschichtung und verleihen der Uhr ein modisches Aussehen. Zudem sind sie mit einer LumiBrite Leuchtmasse gefüllt, damit auch im Dunkeln die Uhrzeit gut lesbar ist.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr verfügt über eine Datums- und Wochentagsanzeige, die sich auf der 3-Uhr Position befindet.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tAuf dem Zifferblattrand befindet sich eine vollständige MinuterieAuf dem Zifferblatt umlaufende Einteilung der Minuten, oft zwischen zwei Kreise eingefaßt (‘Eisenbahnminuterie = sieht aus wie Eisenbahnschienen) und teilweise mit ‘5’-Minutenzahlen versehen. Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie LünetteDie Lünette ist Bestandteil des Uhrengehäuses. Es handelt sich dabei um einen Ring mit Nut, der auf das Gehäuse einer tragbaren Uhr montiert ist. Dieser Ring ist entweder fest verschraubt oder drehbar und eignet sich dann als Anzeige bestimmter Werte (Himmelsrichtung, zweite Zeitzone, Geschwindigkeitsmesser.)\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon mit ist einseitig drehbar und mit einer Minutenskala versehen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin Hardlex Mineralglas schützt das Zifferblatt vor äußeren Einflüssen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDie Uhr wird mit einem Automatikwerk (Kal. 4R36), 24 Steine und 169 Werkteile, angetrieben.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tBeidseitiger automatischer Aufzug (Magischer Hebel)\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tBei vollständiger Ladung hat die Uhr eine Gangreserve\nAls Gangreserve bezeichnet man den Zeitraum, in dem eine Uhr läuft ohne aufgezogen werden zu müssen. Die Gangreserveanzeige beschreibt die verbleibende Zeit bis zum Stillstand einer mechanischen Uhr und gibt so Auskunft, wann eine Uhr erneut aufgezogen werden sollte.\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon von ca. 41 Stunden.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Gehäuse hat einen Durchmesser von ca. 44.30 mm und eine Höhe von ca. 13.00 mm.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tEin schwarzes, hochwertiges Kautschukarmband gewährt einen angenehmen Tragekomfort.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tDas Band wird mit einer DornschließeEine Dornschließe beschreibt die Verschlussart einer Uhr.  In dem längeren Armbandteil werden löcher gestanzt. Auf der anderen Seite befindet sich die Dornschließe, welche aus einem Dorn und einem Metallbügel in U-Form, diese verhindert, dass der Dorn aus dem Loch rutscht.\nDornschließen sind an diversen Materialien zu finden und erstrecken sich in alle Preisklasse. Häufig findet man Dornschließen bei Lederarmbändern oder Textilarmbändern.\n\n Noch Fragen? Hier geht es zum Uhren-Lexikon verschlossen.\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t100 Tage Niedrigpreisgarantie, bei uhrzeit.org kaufen Sie ohne Preisrisiko!\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tFür unsere Waren bestehen die gesetzlichen Gewährleistungsrechte\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\tInformationen zu AutomatikuhrenWas sind eigentlich Automatikuhren?Automatikuhren sind Uhren, welche ein mechanisches Uhrwerk aufweisen und von einem Rotor angetrieben werden. Dieser wird  durch Bewegungen vom Arm bzw. Handgelenk  zum Rotieren gebracht  um die Hauptantriebsfeder aufzuziehen.  Aufgrund dessen wird laufend Energie hergestellt, so dass eine Batterie überflüssig wird. Die Gangabweichungen einer Uhr variieren je nach Fertigung, Kalibrierung beim Hersteller, Lebensstil, sowie Tragegewohnheit des Trägers. Die meisten Automatikuhren haben eine Gangabweichung von -20/+30 Sekunden am Tag.  Dies muss leider akzeptiert werden. Sofern eine höhere Ganggenauigkeit gewünscht ist, sind Uhren mit Chronometerprüfung  eine gute Wahl.  Hier erhalten die Uhren das Bewertungszertifikat COSC, für welches sie im Vorfeld diverse Tests bestehen müssen – erst dann dürfen sie sich als Chronometer bezeichnen. Die Ganggenauigkeit darf maximal -4/+6 Sekunden Abweichung am Tag aufweisen und ist ca. 20 Mal genauer als eine normale Automatikuhr. Um der Ganggenauigkeit positiv entgegen zu wirken spielen die Tragegewohnheiten des Trägers eine große Rolle, denn ein aktiver Uhrenträger kann sich über eine genauere Uhr freuen als ein „passiver“ Uhrenträger.Neben der Ganggenauigkeit spielt auch die Gangreserve eine zentrale Rolle bei Automatikuhren. Die Gangreserve, auch Gangautonomie genannt, bezeichnet die Zeitdauer, in der das Uhrwerk weiterläuft, nachdem sie das letzte Mal bewegt wurde. Hier variiert die Stundenanzahl sehr stark und liegt je nach Uhr zwischen 32 und 60 Stunden.Die Langlebigkeit einer Automatikuhr  kann durch das Verhindern von starken Temperaturschwankungen, unnötigen Stößen, Luftdruckschwankungen und Wasserdruck, sowie das häufige Tragen einer Uhr erheblich verbessert werden. Dies wirkt sich auf alle Teile, insbesondere auf das Uhrwerk, sehr positiv aus.Ein großer Vorteil von Automatikuhren ist, dass sie ohne Batterien auskommen. Des Weiteren entfällt das manuelle Aufziehen der Triebfeder. Somit wird eine lange Haltbarkeit einer Automatikuhr gewährleistet. Das Uhrwerk sollte nach 2-5 Jahren ggf. überholt werden, um die Haltbarkeit weiter sicherzustellen.Zu guter Letzt ist es wichtig zu wissen,  wo der Unterschied zwischen Quarz- und Automatikuhren liegt. Quarzuhren sind im Handel in analoger und digitaler Ausführung erhältlich.  Sie sind elektromechanische oder auch vollelektronische Uhren deren Taktgeber ein elektronischer Oszillator ist. Daher ziehen sie ihre Energie meist aus einer Batterie oder aus Knopfzellen. Einige wenige Ausnahmen gibt es, in denen mechanische Energie über einen Mechanismus  in elektrische Ladung umgewandelt und in Akkus gespeichert wird. Dies ist beispielsweise bei der Linie Seiko Kinetic der Fall. Quarzuhren werden meist als Echtzeituhren bezeichnet. Hieraus lässt sich schließen, dass eine Quarzuhr im Gegensatz zu einer Automatikuhr hinsichtlich der Genauigkeit ganz klar die Nase vorn hat und ohne Bewegung der Uhr absolute Genauigkeit aufweist.Automatikuhren sind besonders interessant für Uhrenkenner. Einen Blickfang stellt der flüssig laufende Sekundenzeiger dar. Häufig sind die Uhren mit einem Glasboden versehen, der einen Blick auf das Uhrwerk und den sich bewegenden Rotor zulässt. Die Faszination der Mechanik einer Uhr liegt ganz klar bei Automatikuhr en!\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\"@de ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":13407150,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":549167,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Seiko 5 Automatic 24 Jewels Men's 100m Rubber Sports Watch SRP601K1 \"@en | Dutyfreeislandshop.com\"@en","description_right":"\"\n        Seiko 5 Automatic 24 Jewels Men's 100m Rubber Sports Watch    \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Brand Seiko Gender Men Glass Type Mineral Scratch Resistant Case Material Stainless Steel Strap Material Rubber Movement Automatic Self-winding, powered by the motion of the wearer’s wrist. Manufactured In Japan Made Movement Features Hackable & Hand Windable 24 Jewels Calendar (Day & Date Display) 40 Hours Power Reserve Rotating Bezel Luminous Hands and Markers Transparent Case Back Display Analog Dial Color Black Case Width 44mm Case Depth 13mm Weight 127g Water Resistance 100m"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":193,"row":{"pair_id":"4976591#12695628","label":1,"id_left":4976591,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":332119,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"G-SHOCK ジーショック GA-100CF-1A9 アナデジ メンズ腕時計 文字盤カモフラージュ（迷彩）柄\"@ja アナ...｜アタック【ポンパレモール】\"@ja","description_left":"\"〈当店在庫〉アナログ×デジタル カモフラージュダイアルシリーズ　\n海外モデル 《並行輸入》　無料ラッピング可\n\"@ja ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12695628,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":332119,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Casio Men's G-Shock Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (GA-100CF-1A9ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This oversized men's Casio G-shock watch has a stainless steel and resin case and is fitted with a chronograph quartz movement. It fastens a black plastic/resin strap and has a black dial.  The watch also has a date function.  Includes alarm function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":194,"row":{"pair_id":"10895580#9651240","label":0,"id_left":10895580,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":959200,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Ball Men's Engineer Hydrocarbon Ceramic XV Chronometer Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DM2136A-SCJ-BK) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Solid gent's Ball Engineer Hydrocarbon Ceramic XV Chronometer, featuring a COSC certified automatic movement, finished to the highest levels of accuracy attainable by a mechanical movement, also featuring a date function. The movement is housed in a solid stainless steel case, water resistant to 30atm, with a screw down case back, crown with Ball's patented crown locking and protection system. To complete the tough credentials of the case, the watch has a scratch resistant ceramic bezel, with luminous inserts, and a scratch resistant, anti reflective sapphire crystal. The watch fastens on a heavy duty stainless steel bracelet, with hidden deployment clasp. For ultimate visibility, this watch is fitted with luminous gas light tubes, so low light visibilty is astonishing, and never fades or requires recharging.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9651240,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":8861668,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Bvlgari Bvlgari Watch BBL33WSPGD\" BBL26WSS 12 | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A fine watch makes a brilliant statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical device, a fine timepiece can also add elegance to your look. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are delighted to offer vast selection of some of the worldâ€™s finest luxury watch brands, including Bvlgari. We are also proud to be an authorized Bvlgari retailer in Los Angeles. Bvlgari's extraordinary timepieces are designed to last. This Ladies watch with model number BBL33WSPGD is part of the beloved Bvlgari collection. It features a precise Automatic (self winding) movement, 18k pink gold, Stainless steel band, and a 18k pink gold bezel.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":195,"row":{"pair_id":"14100885#13492086","label":0,"id_left":14100885,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":10396858,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Polar V800 Watch - Black/Silver\"@en-GB \" Accessories Polar Black/Silver 92052229 \"@en-GB","description_left":"\"\n                                    Polar V800 Watch - Black/Silver\n\nThe V800 from Polar is a Smart Coaching and GPS watch for peak performance that measures a multitude of training data for professional and amateur athletes. The Polar Watch V800 has integrated GPS for speed, distance and route (altitude from barometer), Route guidance & Back-to-Start.\n\n\n                                    \n                                \"@en-GB ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":13492086,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":10739907,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Polar Unisex A300 Bluetooth Activity Tracker Pink Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Unisex Watch (90054239) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"The Polar A300 is a 24/7 activity tracker and fitness watch with sleep tracking, and smart notifications.\n\nPaired with the Polar H10 chest heart rate sensor, this allows you to train to ensure you are training to burn fat or specifically to improve performance and fitness.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":196,"row":{"pair_id":"8014072#16801286","label":0,"id_left":8014072,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":388422,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Mens Casio G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass Alarm Chronograph Radio Controlled Watch GWG-1000-1A3ER\"","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Brand Casio Case Width 51 Case Depth 15 Model Name G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass MPN GWG-1000-1A3ER EAN 4971850028345 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Stainless Steel and Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Hour Markers Batons Strap colour Khaki Warranty 2 years Brand Casio Case Width 51 Case Depth 15 Model Name G-Shock Premium Mudmaster Compass MPN GWG-1000-1A3ER EAN 4971850028345 Water Resistance 200 metres Gender Gents Case Material Stainless Steel and Resin Movement Tough solar Dial Colour Black Strap Type Rubber Analogue/Digital Combination Case Shape Circle Hour Markers Batons Strap colour Khaki Warranty 2 years","id_right":16801286,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":373267,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Casio Men's G-Shock Rangeman Alarm Chronograph Radio Controlled Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (GW-9400-1ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"An oversized design from G-Shock by Casio. This Rangerman edition has a large 53mm case and LCD dial. This watch is jam packed with features such as Super-Full-Auto-LED light, Shock resistant, Solar Power, Radio signal reception (EU, USA, Japan, China),  Barometer (260 / 1.100 hPa), Thermometer (-10�C / +60�C), Digital-compass, 10,000 m Altimeter, Sunrise/sunset display, Altimeter data memory, World time function, Stopwatch function - 1/100 sec - 1.000 hours, Timer - 1/1 min. - 24 hours, 5 daily alarms, Snooze feature, Button tones on/off, Automatic calendar, 12/24-hour timekeeping, Mineral glass, Resin case, Resin band, Battery level indicator and Water resistance classification (20 bar). \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":197,"row":{"pair_id":"3430874#17557500","label":0,"id_left":3430874,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":874058,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Slim Auto Watch H38615735\"","description_left":"\"\n                             A trendy watch is more than just used for for telling time, it is also a remarkable piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H38615735 watch is from the ever popular Slim Auto collection. It features a accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 100 ft (30 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. \n Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This fine timepiece is an incredible way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is thrilled to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can exquisite timepieces are built to last and will be loved for years to come.                         \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557500,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":623869,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton American Classic Valiant Auto Watch H39415654\" H39515734\"","description_right":" so you can all our watches are 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces built to last and will be enjoyed for years come. \" it is also a remarkable piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H39515734 watch comes from the ever popular Valiant Auto collection. It features precise Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits this that water resistant up 150 ft (50 meter) includes Scratch sapphire crystal. with generous 2 international warranty. Are looking an exceptional gift? luxury timepiece way commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers proud authorized retailer A stylish more than just practical telling time","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":198,"row":{"pair_id":"3274009#1259871","label":0,"id_left":3274009,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":3957571,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier\", \"CartierCartier Roadster Series Men's Watch W62041V3\"","description_left":"\"See a beautiful diamond watch or a jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you our FREE layaway plan. Just give us a toll-free call on 1-877-577-TIME or send us an email to sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad to take your order\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Item spec Gender Mens Case Material Stainless Steel Dial Color Black Bracelet Stainless Steel, Calfskin Leather Clasp Hidden Folding Clasp Movement Automatic Bezel Fixed Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Case Back Solid Water Resistant 100m/330ft Case Diameter 44mm x 37mm Case Thickness 10.2mm General Item # W62041V3 MSRP $6,050.00 Brand Cartier","id_right":1259871,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15615928,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier\", \"CartierCartier Pasha Series Men's Watch W31077U2\"","description_right":"\"See a beautiful diamond watch or a jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you our FREE layaway plan. Just give us a toll-free call on 1-877-577-TIME or send us an email to sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad to take your order\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Item spec Gender Mens Case Material Stainless Steel Dial Color Black Bracelet Black Rubber Clasp Hidden Folding Clasp Movement Automatic Bezel Uni-Directional Rotating Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Case Back Solid Water Resistant 100m/330ft Case Diameter 40.5mm General Item # W31077U2 MSRP $6,425.00 Brand Cartier"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":199,"row":{"pair_id":"635668#5348378","label":0,"id_left":635668,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":5317121,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Panerai Radiomir Watch PAM00388\" \"Shop Panerai PAM00323 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This hand-crafted watch, model number PAM00388 from Panerai offers beauty and high tech functionality for watch lovers. This Gents timepiece adopts a distinctive design as well as classic watchmaking details. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the timepiece of insurmountable functionality and distinct style. A black dial comes complete with intricate hour and minute markings that you’ll love. Its automatic (self winding) movement features complications you’ll come to cherish. This watch includes small second hand, date complications. Its complications will make you wonder in awe of the work it took to make this quality timepiece. The numbers on this timepiece are in indexes, arabic style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The neat round case is 45 mm. The case is artfully crafted of stainless steel, both eye catching and was crafted to last a long time. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features gorgeous stainless steel that speaks volumes. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be by your side. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 330 ft (100 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has a stunning selection of watches from the best watchmakers in the world. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5348378,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":13653743,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Carl F Bucherer AutoDate Watch 00.10915.08.13.21\" \"Shop Carl 00.10908.08.13.01 | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p>An elegant timepiece will never fail to express sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Carl F Bucherer gives you just that. This Gents’ watch can definitely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Polished bezel, this rarity represents thorough craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that houses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting White dial color adds a bold sense of luxury. Also important to note is the With anti-reflective coating, Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Date, Central 60 second hand complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. </p>\n<p>This chic and classy watch from Carl F Bucherer has a Folding clasp type and sports a Automatic (self winding) movement. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. This watch also comes with a 2 years international warranty. It is also water resistant for 100 ft (30 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Carl F Bucherer. We are available to clarify any specifications and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":1100,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}